  <Document>
    <name>Digital Map of Roma</name>
    <description><![CDATA[A work in progress. <br><br>The aim is to map out all the different aspects of Roma; Civic Buildings, Housing, Religious Buildings, Industry & Commerce, Entertainment Buildings.<br><br>Any input or contributions are greatly appreciated.]]></description>
