    <Folder>
      <name>Civic</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Aequimelium (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzIaCs1KdF0wBxa2fxKN3VIqVqtziU-rKZq5OMe6gBWRHVnEmOccaVKhB1y70Bp55CIDoO2gp8Rdx6bXUSeSwhqLmPDLn-5iRyuZSdFxFqOGpXrtn3vKvd4QFuyFxJJDFi-faipRSr6EaNigYob9UgcqMdrmXxoz1JamRld2i4EppEpc20C0OsRogSLkqF_Q4iiHsW6ksOZmA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Rome.<br><br>Open space on the SE slopes of the Capitol, which functioned as a memorial against tyranny. It was an area kept free from construction and its name commemorated the levelling of the house of a would-be tyrant of the 5th c. BC, Spurius Maelius. It was a place to buy sacrificial animals, and it still existed in the Augustan period. It stood on the lower slopes of the Capitol by the Vicus Iugarius, below the retaining walls of the Area Capitolina. Thus Pisani Sartorio puts it N of the Forum Bovarium, Coarelli more specifically between the Area Sacra di S. Omobono and Piazza della Consolazione. It only occupied the former site of a single house, so it cannot have been large.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gws8EdQyetfP3YamhvM-JbgU1mPrCVT3dyvWwJ_5CORBTQ1s__sBMMMfrEBfWPoejsU1FzPuAYKEI8TOTNOptdDGt1o1xUz08LbNkNUocbWTAfiHjovfBkWz7OFT7dC0iYzia_H56H4xJYsmu0qEYsAEDrkd5J_D2ixD0m84FrHUnQWB60P-XTS3TMNyFhkx3KfpkDtP7F8VA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1599-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzIaCs1KdF0wBxa2fxKN3VIqVqtziU-rKZq5OMe6gBWRHVnEmOccaVKhB1y70Bp55CIDoO2gp8Rdx6bXUSeSwhqLmPDLn-5iRyuZSdFxFqOGpXrtn3vKvd4QFuyFxJJDFi-faipRSr6EaNigYob9UgcqMdrmXxoz1JamRld2i4EppEpc20C0OsRogSLkqF_Q4iiHsW6ksOZmA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gws8EdQyetfP3YamhvM-JbgU1mPrCVT3dyvWwJ_5CORBTQ1s__sBMMMfrEBfWPoejsU1FzPuAYKEI8TOTNOptdDGt1o1xUz08LbNkNUocbWTAfiHjovfBkWz7OFT7dC0iYzia_H56H4xJYsmu0qEYsAEDrkd5J_D2ixD0m84FrHUnQWB60P-XTS3TMNyFhkx3KfpkDtP7F8VA?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
          </Data>
        </ExtendedData>
