      <Placemark>
        <name>Arcus Titi (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v70AbmjwvFlwD77pu9KIjU4Zo2UILUw1MVCvL2LdYe-RW4TFZBKV5bUMyzb3mp68BNPTSEfM69u3jup9yFi0C5i3TUvQQZuEfvUmCbAUaV5cUr8RS1qpt60SwSePvAfj65EnMAxXh7isNcYFXITc-wNCaBU2_FueWX8GLSRymAE8WLYT8g_wcynpcZNp0kmdAXJ-OldVJ8w1qqdoOrfasDND-YVh6mpOoTGShXzCGt1ZN6d1p9P2LmequXotu78Hyoh9DPTJN1z8YJrEsIZ-AhVpEP3RBnPD23tuYcXJWu8VZbHeock7JmpTj6tLABroDGVVHoSG95Cf2i5882sfY17T4HXgQyQA3uHpjorlxJtV9FyVp6cGqTTh_PaQ47Wky8BYlZ32LyifuNJGRt2hOdzQPXJM8MMwb9lrKoBhHZHDROSB8OTHNqpnZovVJ5LORzi-P1CSvgaqWYuQaQNijVaovIfPA-GZbJ0kMeHkaT3eGQ0lBQNJyrJDze7O9OzIXyZL_aQ-Ch25pZD5peD2u4Atw2Wvgfamun2k2kXkHAoSetGFg9splu9XdyiqJ6AFcg_ZwgQ2_HtfTeROwSd5-DDHsVYZLUJg4hahnruk-XtEO0TeGaCzZeBRSgOSfYN5XDJ2sKR_pFBb4SIpFM_8Sc4j--S0y3Q02Sa072EusFq087_X0QRQowU0UCXRBHwnl9Asg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Arch of Titus, Rome, 1st c. AD.<br><br>It is a 1st-century AD honorific arch, located on the Via Sacra, Rome, just to the south-east of the Roman Forum. It was constructed in c. 81 AD by the Emperor Domitian shortly after the death of his older brother Titus to commemorate Titus's official deification or consecratio and the victory of Titus together with their father, Vespasian, over the Jewish rebellion in Judaea. The arch contains panels depicting the triumphal procession celebrated in 71 AD after the Roman victory culminating in the fall of Jerusalem, and provides one of the few contemporary depictions of artifacts of Herod's Temple. It became a symbol of the Jewish diaspora, and the menorah depicted on the arch served as the model for the menorah used as the emblem of the state of Israel.<br><br>The arch has provided the general model for many triumphal arches erected since the 16th century—perhaps most famously it is the inspiration for the Arc de Triomphe in Paris, France.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwGfaDJLqlI1VZ0alC7IMGQOmuDv2gGxOhJ8L2sldDTDUhxy1SduhZYe4xljXmhrclY1x-ThflMmgV7D2RsIXx5An9MWucHl8RerQDZ399RUnj3sMlx0AAfC8Qx0nuhJmqBc9WsRMIy5zbAa_X0iT7PMd2CHwf1-lNoH6-B-0efSPQHXh-BvLtoUK5nw1UvuYB3zFrvruaIHQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwSKbQbImkmQXdLzB19x2f1BfGrNikPXzXVtFk4dYjbREMNSsgmYoV5w7TRerj0OrMXaxKqdq52vaidNTwRLyzWN5i0oku2iSA7npD6lVg7E8dA6ee8Wo6e5IK6rMSxsqFHQnqNqCMkhlv-eA1bGJ5thgssUoIgO8pJbLGPJPftNqqVCunStbkMsrLuGA-qPWAyVcJWxSpTwg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxcKp0hxnNZJPLmU3ZJjhVtXu6bcLKYJj4FySWmZ31Vm3beGBKTbrSS2jnOiDroo5HohZ5CvImG3pRvULRkwXbiXSus3ynTKD2sNasQ7-wWFKDnSbG_lsyHsRS5r68J7NtYXlhNWIcQtQCX6p1cActOj0PrKa1K03Ps8w_lYJ5TTVLuZ7lGwU0iuZoTnUVCXX_ho2ure6H9cQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
