      <Placemark>
        <name>Basilica Iulia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5qDN8HvLDMcRaZwQGIGI7LCAACaIJv6cXWH8v7OvqHB1HQdWbRMU67hsrh8VMFy4Z1NYcz-xGZXSzSUE2krrLEtItzkrjsK2FyVArEuFqqoSkvVeZd6E3oRjgxFK-KRHxHEwXFo9BH2xFWbziNH4deZgvyq0c7lvcSi04mQiJfxh7kd2vVNon5y_7er4xcLxljywgYSfNg6dRKfBJe8z3LFpHpQUU7i-FM8ikT4ML9cabIL1UrTUpUGjwxnCnXNifKYr3S3TkcQL6XZIHQ4ITLWm53TWmtpQ3S5HhbvtmIQjzIQOWws9fa-fzpLAvnClgXatW8jZCY1CFhV3hrQY5Nv7d-iRw6RGBI5QpU3q5CCq0zGE3k4qRpL8aRz5GBl47nzAQIJA0T3mHd6KQhsGxZLyyDuxuFa76E_fNYqLhloqR8EYuWj6ME-UNADVUF7MhHt9NyjbqIbF2tK5xz-nd40zVLlPHXjG02JdQdjvSYx07Z0EiUEwZgGy-Y6R5wXm63yCGKeo4600Al3ZJwMJ2E6ZN2d80m0dTOhTC5BYEq4AMYgCBvRJpxAKQ4z6n4-vkUvEDUrTv6rrJiCSot7D5JMDvz3bih0u2QGXmTlWq7p-Ar4QhljJuClZ_X9k4X8M8wNrRMNy39YMb5ZOPxqyYFavYxAm7qQ8AuZhOHUZ83IaL6GBaU2k70hEzYysQ2ErTIR62zata-EQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Rome.<br><br>The monumental basilica along the S side of the Forum, between the Vicus Iugarius and Vicus Tuscus, begun by Caesar c. 54 BC to replace the Basilica Sempronia of 169 BC was dedicated unfinished in 46 BC and later completed by Augustus. This basilica burned (12 BC?) and was rebuilt by Augustus in the names of his adopted sons Gaius and Lucius in 12 AD; later references show that the name Basilica Gaii et Luci did not achieve currency. This rebuilding probably engulfed the Lacus Servilius, a monumental fountain which Festus located ‘at the beginning of the Vicus Iugarius, adjacent to the Basilica Iulia’.<br><br>Only the pavement and the foundations of the basilica’s pillars have survived, but the broad dimensions of the structure are clear. Restorations to the Basilica Iulia by Diocletian and by the urban prefect Gabinius Vettius Probianus in either 377 or 416 AD do not appear to have altered the dimensions of the Augustan Basilica Iulia, part of which is represented on the Severan Marble Plan.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5GWh-u9-Z2JVJZFYYcKCyL8njm04UzvO9nEKQt_CWdkbBs6v1zEF8EbdHjE2lCkk7uqtgBqUaOm5Yc