      <Placemark>
        <name>Curia Iulia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4PfMSf_rBDsxYThRvDUrM3aU0-5Lc3RwG3EN20FPY7A-EbFjgLR5YRGvuKybvFxiCurHUg0CEL7GkBeui-xeRmWtUdewOPp9y9AX-OWJfmCzVoR31_DgB8lLWo_AM6kqAzpa-1NDVmtUBRjzmQvyEh_ipgxC_X1lZ6b7ez7EM9NItdQCGztRzDii0XqY3qrL34EpdtOU2Jxxqk0zXfDR3pBAsreepBvhzeyrc7FlVaspstCtUyV-vHhlPWQM8JXtvSpyADq9J3sFDIdSY5UD8qXflhzDzQrRRaoMPYFFgr52AwaH1hlczaNqMY48S3D3o7kqD0mqM6IijbzT2p89jyx37agVHmktAW9Y9SU1kUH3kdGJS0Ywgh1HCyT6_ZM2c5WHhBn0IkYX386hOBHdj6C3QyTl0g9Lx-Jq_yGDub4_wy3N6MFgEPgU0anHErkl_Hw6bseGmy_dv8lu5MCRWamFp-LFDX6NY3Sl2aMS_kWGPksqxXX8TNwrIgVv_tI56MyRc_y3DOWWyzluulRefziYZfme0jqZYxrS3N3qWe08F-jUGwc6wDZ6h0YtwOLs6OmgNtu1_nX6mIR9XzatSyN3U3T6I0RRD71yKGPsaJeX2NLZLCTgJil0MtUdIWYxzA0zkUWXgQrKmRikPkHGRAdZt_r9OgGXbIR_aPYjLlAsFJJFb6DBaB0195ACYv_Qq8cihPRrxVow" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Senate House, Rome.<br><br>The Senate house on the N side of the Forum projected and perhaps begun by Caesar in 44 BC and essentially built by Augustus in 29 BC. Built in conjunction with the new Forum Iulium, the Curia Iulia replaced the Curia Hostilia which Faustus Sulla had recently rebuilt following its burning in 52 BC.<br><br>Diocletian restored the Curia after the fire of 283 AD, but excavations in 1986 revealed that the Diocletianic building, which we see today, had the same orientation and dimensions as the Augustan Curia.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6Kf6P7IWje1_2EK4B3-VE1upzPTshzMxbG89U7TsD7CtPURgX4yW38Q6k9ZYoXVPAWjYqbqPaaKUNjkCnxp0DzokqnNoEogV0l15pBKA1nw6HN0l5wTf3pOPeeAKyHRBICRYNQF1EJ9tspt-DIY3v5ZF3pZfQ0F_0vmcLWodPOGP0iLTeIbnxiPmD0iVHMtgzQpNRPGVf5pj5cU058Pdu8NvjK0FrFniMugCkj7fyiCujfVP8n-xE7jmtUY6Mctj89ZL4kAbG-EIcJnl_t_9djVbuP5NExjRIReDJaMj7GDNYDFH-pNGjIa1leEFGo6G3GLOUvbqgyxLvMvgDDY-281st5vYn3-6FCfQU7nC66JcHFsFAPftEFaacUk2KEqAo48fEtnNkAfBnEf3OXSVAJoRkuQfPCNLVd0CyZ4PuU3k7aH1k38wrx_FT3XuGBqQb1UPi-YFgSPAMMnTXYVkLl9hYMvsC2WrQBIFJG5cD678bmFxqmARN2r9r2w36sShMgx0pw1ld338e4pKOG_WcFKJB8UUDJSSF9ohKpdWxC9tzKIhsd0wrr50uCU80nIT27w3O3C1HT1IsZbIpL1u3Py5x73IZ5WfIssNESqrv39AeiToKb3gknvlTHdaAJqS4apXIpQNI8YPU3YA4UCLaDFzDVd2Gji-b5iJZzhOmiPfdfhfOJWqhz1Y4BeDJNJfOzbSm0-_YWGQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5fcJRAdZQgSe1hlz7X01udAonArDyMHr46MIFkMr-U1icvYYGhPYgiTMYMW3PYTdvy8UTOBcP-kw0SFGQzJUQpMUDfmFgjbB2JvEpa0geMb-pqYEXJ3bMuFhDe5KcyXvezxWGupyszJ70QKWKVpObwtTCWBMPaQXpqna2fOUmk6gCju8hUJg1Abb5bsL0gkdwLV5e44H_5Wnh9ePWdKmzU2--Eku2InVy7UcJHbLdPlVrVFCdcrggLhYZEErvhApoYdp7mronhWSm6Lo5nP_2RJ28Rzoa7sRmwjwVGDHZwVEnJkVMJ3i5SsL-Yf1bHZ3-8H94ZFUANTdQTVS7YpV3s2ZYW_SJs7QX_CE4BUqc-CrqWFtbHUqn9-yJqBHCWaiF2Z5kzZwg9uhVpdSioi9aYREf87W2CDw2feJwj8MhWreyjsQ0grn3430tmdeAfPrk4WuEK-3pe_YRNAkcOVE9X9cm-V9aByB9mF-1-KWOIelE6xF7ApFhnDRRuF45LJRxVGUSrTm-OK6TYqAsfmLChoYOJILyrGCk2e4EDMGqlTKstOunIsuyNIgeI3oHF1VKdxEOwiQ4_nEG6wT8-MiLC_-6Y_rxTFu7obF0sNuOdH9E9cbfRKBv7bSlbM7HMJILCOAe8LiSvJpuzo0N5je4m7sucpjVfQgzKhrmRsjWgK1W_RHZSylo0iR3IzF4jr_SjzEkyjGrE5w" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
