      <Placemark>
        <name>Forum Nervae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6TZCkJBOPhl6j-rsYYxiFJRdYhHRTNH4hMC_RXZt5o2_1bDuOMNCOSlML8MMe5CBKuwtU9xeDnV-O9T_VTD-HiqzZGqNbA8xx0SVCPtx12-IXVbm_RUkswlzwic8MOCg4ZI3FVv_EJVNJwlaSdqpLjITQDWCzyW3XTl3MpOFPdZMQ0Ef1k6PDWtSz07GQmOFUdMhJVG7f4NDh8vGafzPc0nMwqUR3DTI_pmycmZVyOId2nuZQ10wq8DgmBjNGPAfz72mygStGUJY9T83zeeXPSL-RPZUj3n50cvQdlnDaFFI2ktXN_0Gw_wGPvBaY8VLJz8najGJhlbLQAwDraQzZ5Z-RUC6dc4VO9-_cNFqkyXGwSia-qyE0RO1hnmXzfkTpk39Tqfi76ArWlXIswTa3cOhROxmAQD99EPtsv0LHJEjcg-IIxESkSVXvWD9H3qlVw9RVfyEsGLT4IRWZK-pwYH2BIDQMQ9aUEfzqkVV01lIdMsslTeL6uXoHdJu8Os-O7JR1LkrTigasAOV2s7-92dvUD-A2uOO5WATMZ5IWxAW3qbPJr64v9MflxiJUA8AjpDOCeAdYJma1OkRpVSTro75GZc0vfikrDWtE-CDzzKHX2-MVHiXqnmJfVQSyZCrtn_L7ZoQxhg9FczrTKQ43-yADdlcvgm1irTkjeZi1KkUAHnJRyAsOxYI2i0SXoL9TSeOU5-jRfxA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Forum of Nerva, Rome.<br><br>The Forum of Nerva was the fourth and smallest of the imperial fora. Its construction was started by Emperor Domitian before the year 85 AD, but officially completed and opened by his successor, Nerva, in 97 AD, hence its official name. This street had long served as a market area, especially for booksellers and cobblers; the new forum continued to serve as both a thoroughfare and as a monumental entrance to the larger Roman Fora.<br><br>The plan of the Forum of Nerva is long and narrow, with protruding columns decorating the walls instead of arcades. A temple dedicated to Minerva dominated the western end, behind which was a monumental entrance.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4cJbrS5EUYVXK4GVA3vAekzLkJ2M6VRsxXBtjzdNTHLA2qUGo-EJ9WYNJdsDT4x7APNiMTufTQC9VBqxe5-IbmmevW9S4BmkxS2jAB6IpPisqrZJjnup0wYy8oG5VFuTMWqN2zL_b5LFOFQA0yYS_o9cTzFKwncvXKaUQzsz8z_9nkgV6pCNQZ2lNRmpRU8YgeUHQESbihKM7W1PhibWAdIaPCtxTj8mefGHSZFuzkj9rmsFCOndCNu8bWQjSY69vJYYG0WPZ2TtJnjjx-NWn1MAiqczjxHAsgAP3CxLJGyWYAe0wXYcVJLd0YzPOaRzDeF3ITnDGpNQDbmFlLooNOJg2YiBZRRMBSmujl-QCM6ag4IVE2Vg2OKGYeWick7iDJSW6sX0mB6x8FYu4ENcxsQCTmfw9Yp