      <Placemark>
        <name>Forum Traiani (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5ys_5L2mQfdtEW4mYY_jqrEk13ukEmRjY7ngAQsf9r4psx1Yr8lrBceq0q-APrCbhFCIYrxS4976NJugHUDMF4bQescUp6BD4hwmH7dv3TWa3rZ0moTSm1K5_z_Cza6AWzGXyyGShIWdhzt4T142jq9PlpCrZZRSRu1KJb2ICVAYdOCO0sM5Aa1phv6maA_tOEJv2TgkFOtPmkGAipFpJZGf_7sJ4URYLu_YVrvNTP0yqXTk-eXdwwDhPSIHkMNeNeM5fY9POmtNp2wUyGtE4xZ0keFynoH80Sw50kc4zvPvm4xhTGsEc4hYqVQBm6rOOazLdgnEudJvPxLXroST4w2QI5BXUw13oKRjwlOaQrcx-mPB7CHzeQQMio4FQMioBFrF4im6jjqYFfLpQKqniEjPm3jSSuXZ1NcCi6SCpo_NLAcrGibrFAf9AY2gwBejZIOcaCM2CgrBXel5Vi7sL9EjZr8CUu3UvDVniZ3E8YTmirutMlHfZ148Z-Fc_CBL4nqRxAK9aQ9ikBcmOKIr1JMYrFDrP659Migi0AN1OBhxF1SyslR7bHWykaOfzOBdpgbB0jpFe60dRkM9EalBh-iPrCP4EDT1a9miV4ujU6zpi30-sCYM4uyeVhDO4KfKqGXkOcGfg6tK4DSEFF7oZZTQnV1_8wA-XG-9BmwCBd0fhVCFICYaZj7LNZc-ci3Xg1c3ZQ_-t_gg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Forum of Trajan , Rome.<br><br>The Forum consisted of a vast portico-lined piazza measuring 300 metres (980 feet) long and 185 metres (607 feet) wide, with exedrae on two sides. The main entrance is at the north end of the piazza, which was cobbled with rectangular blocks of white marble and decorated by a large equestrian statue of Trajan. On either side of the piazza are markets, also housed by the exedrae. The main part of the Forum was a large open space about 300 feet by 380 feet.<br><br>North of the Basilica was a smaller piazza, with a temple dedicated to the deified Trajan on the far north side facing inwards. The position of - and very existence of - the temple dedicated to the deified Trajan is a matter of hotly contested debate among archaeologists, particularly clear in the ongoing debate between James E. Packer and Roberto Meneghini. Directly north of the Basilica Ulpia on either side of the forum were two libraries, one housing Latin documents and the other Greek documents. Between the libraries stood the 38-metre (125-foot) Trajan's Column.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6qkcKeuTa-paHbf1i0ob7g6IT_MBS5Vt_sArGJbKQv_2PjUybRwi77_GxN2yo9m9J3drh0G8jZ83adiZZUBUbQ1Lm56Nl_7Vdx050WNZu6Y8LhouS3QVfDFlPuhKG9tVD3QaN9lFsRwjqbUJ9bph5aL0CP4EkfrYh4t2ZdGeQwnuQU8AFkvdpWpF8cKRGbZC9Ubif6GTIsjkRS114pmK51mzdzT3HsAz3hlmNjlyD5naLyvWk7PNb3hyqgajVMfwBDBCVmUvL3ePVh4BAtq0wIaJHKyJmWFmPJkB-Rb7z8DU11RIgVVmeGSYCbObBtDpYHDdxWM4vi-lNWkISUEjwsasiaFnv0uLvhXx20iRUq12o6IRHmaFH1NYUlNt4a4KRsBH9InKaP_fnWHbPBnx98l2VVrp9QlImN2gRAz9-iDLtmr--2wAvpokY4_32-_Eil29bX2ikz6vNZ6mwkeji75N0Lz95W0k5IKPug0QAECu_JI637pPffk8QgW9uuAyRzmRbfHYo71icLwMWXwZnBkiVa8XX_g8YLDjRXQ0aO28mPd6xgkZvUVA7s2T9mM86MqtXjfzYpvwm7LF-BR5kb3STLVx0iJT_VwWDr8GpsWv6n8OLsQYcapcfn3bh34_4hVVtAB0MTUO_wU5jXXe472mFf-6QihbvoaFMN-hEnoYoM7cDcwJV25Tfgjx-A8MunOQ3Z8NWnVQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6xirEk5DsoNM0vBazk9N-Xm4PnkNFaqeh4tYJ4LYkVOcEHN-vHaIgYFiWINDt-j4FtF7tn9l-Hp1bYXQ4PANx0ee7TjC5s75Fbrp6pG1mHYf8PM4Bb_uM2lc6qjPm6v1rs6y1z_oyRFCoeh3ZjsTExTFpZRJ4PY5GilftYkh24wN2FdnYnuuEcklu0jOshViZP9hTU2SstM_Rjw6m7bhrPRMyTGu38iigbWw-6dn5DsWzPsgF2xIq-ZzeOrF85Kut1Em_jJAE8h1BpvK4UTP9GEN-ji25vjRWmpvfVdt55j_lIEco-9i5_UnPKu64qabGDel-EfvJAUjLcKD5NtVIQNXiu_pEnDFXsq_FNmyMWKRorSel_pOInhGy4ztTmU4uZSNzPo0-CxOefrhfTq9_09597DpdPXXwhNE9J_IDW_vuJv-tZbo-C12BwobbgI1DFXsuSQbfGObP14czj4kFhJO2Q5XagdFClKtrOh9j4Lsii5eBVPt-KZ2MxhB_f6pfkA5MoPUAimSuCAqrOlqk3Vtpke3SU7IZFL01R1phJE-qDN9rZqfI9DNUWxZ_2yxkf2bYuGhigJus9QuZjddMxaDdTOH93ZWhmYEcn5UCk042ePdXBWRnRlPmeMM5lU5lYWlwGpEybyLoH7LyFdFFUzWhsaOzQXMlM-NRdvkS-ch-icYH1fGh6mGZvj-CnCMhEu3rV24JRbA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6W7rq_mCtw5LyG20xoFL_1nNYQjRNxF_BMeTa8AxT7mmhPdRkStwypPc_9HyRAaGySOyuls0VfzIoxVSA7nw85ZIjs-RT9lrUswhg9M5zalGL-v3Nna9hT_MLrUR-d_YP7Wa9jb2qiKnjYa-sBONJ2dhCcfKAdzfp24f9G_BV5IGDko2Ufo2uY1gVcyUweJXPHFE206sbuVPNg2rpB0svmuE8JtXFWYrZDncWsP3oE3prxI6SG3WKjwanvddwPUaal-Hn0R-HfXfQJqUP3AvqqxLAMQZzsSMBVVQEzLIwKFs6sQK1osOSO2xXJZ-XO7jXc8xI-Khp0p-nZlyoyqdse1SddB8m6FzJqFe-kdAxxw0YV9HQp3tyWXMJwO2Fq1F8oNO7cdYoOyD5x3-j90_ExNKj