      <Placemark>
        <name>Pons Sublicius (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6TtV6lmiFCkSnArjYeGsUX460w8ppH2O0jCQTPQwd_7yLWhVehIJcqW2tbCq5gsmZnXb0dj9WYxjNNFxAu-RMNsGKarkfaYFKKtqdOLi4hFMeYJXJaSDN8tRowz0Gvgb4kagbFU41rPMUg1khaoiRi21m5T34sSE4pMhgNIT63h32ZST6cR81WaXwGR4AwKP9npSOg5SO8KEbtgDgc1sUX3cUJIE9x5geYGS1VsrsPzetByXWfWWg3k366C8KbBTno_OUzFuztx3-IPE6dtGpordRrVXZaoxCoqN74RdHgpE2dw6g3Zk1Ca9aGtVec2byoUqYAC5vB_ziuA_jG2FuBTkAIlALF6OFMQgWT1Z6sOvPQER-3F2DCoRifr8pTUjjOgGR6Va68FJty8T6c064rNNwcYFhtEnwJS-uAJ2xx7ORC_jwqcUFqyI-opdo9o2qH_0AMCU8viJzIvcUdy-4_oJqosxjxgThvsQjyknLN9-FvfHN6k2S7nN9t2UjvyoyuxmZ2dPazpxOG5DQ4kHRMBf_em9sNuyztP7YV57vCP_JfJqdKOhPpSHhyihhK4QjXJ72PldJjxwjJcnp6hLnQHtT0uREZS1XuuMKQMn77Dlbe61xRITtLK80yS3AW2Gj_l-dtk3Bf51JraWHejYDa6J3B13NpgkcvQc20yGCKyIAhum5zhTyFAqta8S6hSWcxJyE1wFU-tw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Bridge of Sublicius, Rome.<br><br>The most ancient and fragile bridge of Rome, the ‘bridge of piles’, presents a difficult topographic problem, since it was never substantially built. It stayed mainly as a timber construction on stone pile foundations and so did not survive after the 5th c. AD.<br><br> Its exact location is still unknown. It joined the Forum Bovarium to Trans Tiberim, possibly providing an important connection with the Aventine through the Porta Trigemina, and on the right bank to the slopes of the Ianiculum as well as directly to the Via Campana. Le Gall has proposed a well-reasoned location for the bridge, downstream from Pons Aemilius; locating its left-bank head immediately S of the Round Temple by the Tiber, between the Cloaca Maxima and the “Cloaca Circi Maximi”. Coarelli’s topographical studies of the Forum Bovarium follow this placement at least for the left-bank head of the bridge. The location of the Transtiberine bridgehead is more obscure; fragment 27 of the Severan Marble Plan, which depicts the right bank across from Forum Bovarium area, neither represents the bridge nor offers a convenient street for it to join.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4HOOFGeJPLcrTMg6zWzQRI-PLFZg3cUAeURaqvrmGcLM-cvrL3Ek2rozZJAH2nXOIPi51AmSDwlzpNtF9gdEgXGH62EwR6Kh1ptf-DXyUfhAhAchtMVTqqyjgjOo6rKk2-2aMa-XmwPZNxo492KzrT91UVTjV52E524NDGmUcqh79DaxfcsZngb9w6W6k9gGLjwBZFrluWv6emJ6SJQ9NsaC3cFOmKJd8kbni-wL5Dei791G-sqVseLvLczCuaTphYgH8XiqamQAcCC_xtARKR1LGD352aJXZ8hTyjKVkwNjlnQ4BpNh1A1HOEupJz3awY_BwbtxDxJKLIuNTW53pic_pmVr1K3hnHsLq_Urkk4DVZ4RHvTe8Vg0W7wFK9w4SlQ9C_j74lk3c1OKe1r8r9L6uy-sbVUJliXGWEkwNp9lgGAoCxgccL2qBvrtzf9vks5RTaX5eW6tKkkHN4U2WMh-mKmt0sTMP4RbI7nsY9if63jBRIsmw85CFNXMGZtLq3pZ6ZpuYHY2igfqIi9svvjAm-Cp6692Kd0SEZCT0NeF4ptnPXX3NMmwsXzo21V3L3UnMWguo1vnAfRFa4GzuIORgcTBx_TbaWxg8VK4tKJg_Z2s_XgZob5_Q0aXRa8vt8DnkI-XcUCuPO6fo-JJ9H1noxSw-wdKOSIcJbU3u-W7w6tQ99fbx36g1CaCu8E1IlHyROtJcj" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7rr7NlZnlNJdnh2NnVVMC9OBR1ZBcFk71vzZuODG66FhCTcp2arDCcQIT-tn51VUWKEk0tvsE3b8opR7hOSKPXPpqy7f-jiEUpQoN9O1GgTZhrAh_H3a134InKbQzZW_PVRtm2BaoUVUKHnkXunZxs9kBKjlFrEMZPTR5aPR2ZEwvZ0erllVRSjAzx0d8TZeaw1vYD94sLDqpA8bb1dlLHk1AEzT3gl_98w-ijbE6L5e0AcH99djvy0sIfL-0MZMI1uSqJLH7LucqZknBGqX-E70NE0LxuA5gAJL_QxS4aq4-1uH_ZqLmRuludNFaqY5uOoE54DtkaECliEPpOBi_5gF2zlZc86kjJiEPU31491goYOJVKm3x0dNz9lwGIXZWG6rA8bNo5vCWHKp-v161Cmi7UzTP5gd3-V4HRSr_Qbw0AcykbbS8Dci8UgLa8xSwmj3jrD-mIvrgWRMZK-lkNdDHtc7VwPxYBuRRZzYiZeY8NNg5kdmYCIGIEb4yCawSti8aZqUx-zAFcZmRT5dmf9IsyVJojLl8wd5VI65n3-faoifEWkF6xjAPcQL0-x0Wzgbjt0NefUQ_drLZG7GlShpdSXcUUnjB-d-1jor7FkFeLSus8PN0lMYnC_IzHM2wAAmfUIx6DcuJGSc3mv2vJxkntIbNSLh2KaG7HGgsjecPSQROyn32j332-XTqG80UQG9npS4eWWA" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
