      <Placemark>
        <name>Porta Flaminia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw0B8KjPhvc9Y5V_oFoMQKjCrM7vKlRWeZubpfscm0rwIVOsIn1N5LaQ7CM69-fmOLAqGc1SIH2h67-fJ5yof0PKqi9mY9fIY9r01VDhK2ZvZgHE1XYbZ1VPubJPi7C7u4m34zJcyFRJHUxCWYi1X_iwGscLQbzAypDnZxjygrb1LrOLcJ3VWVi-yjrr2vStgF_VZAl7O1WFg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Aurelian Walls, Rome.<br><br>It was called Porta Flaminia because the consular Via Flaminia passed, as it passes even now, through it (in ancient times, Via Flaminia started at the Porta Fontinalis, close to the current Vittoriano). In the 10th century the gate was named Porta San Valentino, due to the basilica and the catacomb with the same name, rising at the beginning of Viale Pilsudski.<br><br>The origin of the present name of the gate, as well as of the piazza that it overlooks, is not clear: it has been supposed that it could derive from the many poplars (Latin: populus) covering the area, but it is more likely that the toponym is connected with the origins of the Basilica of Santa Maria del Popolo (Saint Mary of the People), erected in 1099 by Pope Paschal II thanks to a more or less voluntary subscription of the Roman people.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzdbDYL4RD3_E9yxqK_yL1zy6JrWlCIGl7d0Yaq7RQLIYzJIdQh7RByNApSsFw6GAc76KZUezAexWUsJaApWbJdWzTa349gB8a0XtQdS_Go_h_zGweCyCrxKkOWROvRus6R2vpfBeTZSlhXsouIeWAty7eJL-atq5KgodEWL1O9Gg_tiAa_O9Q1cQOzAtrbiRP86oXOaF-amA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1598-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw0B8KjPhvc9Y5V_oFoMQKjCrM7vKlRWeZubpfscm0rwIVOsIn1N5LaQ7CM69-fmOLAqGc1SIH2h67-fJ5yof0PKqi9mY9fIY9r01VDhK2ZvZgHE1XYbZ1VPubJPi7C7u4m34zJcyFRJHUxCWYi1X_iwGscLQbzAypDnZxjygrb1LrOLcJ3VWVi-yjrr2vStgF_VZAl7O1WFg?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzdbDYL4RD3_E9yxqK_yL1zy6JrWlCIGl7d0Yaq7RQLIYzJIdQh7RByNApSsFw6GAc76KZUezAexWUsJaApWbJdWzTa349gB8a0XtQdS_Go_h_zGweCyCrxKkOWROvRus6R2vpfBeTZSlhXsouIeWAty7eJL-atq5KgodEWL1O9Gg_tiAa_O9Q1cQOzAtrbiRP86oXOaF-amA?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
