      <Placemark>
        <name>Porta Metronia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxsrCIbp5ayj4kaDCCPJjvEsZ-wfR1KyPmVCzxC3psvDfqqY0a3T_hmPdz22hPqCBjANbK2kkh4AG6WJ6wVappqwUSkAA8mO1XiAtMa6Tc44YQ2VzBXEztn46UdNA-ZgLDDW8Sy5zxYLiR4K1keZnfJeSuXZeDELf0IEtzFwVwWGZd8Du3uRUX65JrYgZM879XCJRUihZb9Zg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Aurelian Walls, Rome.<br><br>The gate is located in the southern section of the wall between Porta San Giovanni to the east and Porta Latina to the south.<br><br>At the end of the Middle Ages, the gate was closed and the entrance bricked up. Because of increasing traffic in the modern era, four main passages were created beside the original gate. The ground level around the gate has risen significantly through the ages, leaving the original passage partially underground.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1598-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxsrCIbp5ayj4kaDCCPJjvEsZ-wfR1KyPmVCzxC3psvDfqqY0a3T_hmPdz22hPqCBjANbK2kkh4AG6WJ6wVappqwUSkAA8mO1XiAtMa6Tc44YQ2VzBXEztn46UdNA-ZgLDDW8Sy5zxYLiR4K1keZnfJeSuXZeDELf0IEtzFwVwWGZd8Du3uRUX65JrYgZM879XCJRUihZb9Zg?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
