      <Placemark>
        <name>Porticus Gaii et Lucii (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v68Y6cGTToGQiuONr5lWNcYTRZ5ser9LVfD4mhOid8WKu7ZwBJKJDTJWsoGz7vDp1Lk75vrrl2lnQTu93rAeOl3HdymJ_MVwxANTneHochGZy3jcuZ4AlREwLRndU6i8UgphD0Xb6SqZeeHXu00Dd3ZwF14DbUKN0ewGd9K9FwbsilNfpOiE-j53XIEAN4DwgeX2JmI0-6_N_BCV6XAlpOCSmWyyl7KscutgXIdsUyYEU74e0dof3A06ZxG94JtQC6npJmooKu6zR4J3hYIYFvCKd1T9mS9QhlLK6NtBqqG_EbY5pUYF_pK5anSrL2YSonWPzLn0RkFGekndYj8uPaoKr1Ougpob22omYaHnsI8y8EnbT8Z0kj6d33636MZ1wsgw2rXqPc96oHL911g0uTvMTvtOdulIbxwh-6p0WusL20TaximJPlP4Z8Q98pr3kfKV-zy-ml3_wT-PmHWcH_3q-COs2__g-A1FoJMEfeap6dsKUGlOZTlZnXWyPxN4Vik7HyGTEzvWKWBxhiL02mQayNdOTlfoOboyRT2-f8-EVknS9ygoBzEDNaVesSLUr01aoyCaV6HiBhXJVRNi1YjAQJCl4vT0k-MZo49KfAGI2bx5QIau793TvDDKnUWWp7lLFQzJ8JSdpG5A0nprHz3GBre6oh-rV24rP19XJ1-ZsCqnGqiu6923T5xiRdn4unsWvcBzH4XSQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Portico of Gaius and Lucius, Rome.<br><br>A series of 15 shops (tabernae) and a two-storey arcaded portico ran in front of the Basilica Aemilia and shielded it from the Forum. It is commonly identified as the Porticus of Gaius and Lucius, but sometimes as the porticus Iulia.]]></description>
