      <Placemark>
        <name>Porticus Octavia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6OiOp6uxTR5sYY3rtab14vsl2XRaAYW5VcSWvx-5UDHLzw9ISdMZjCnGkP1rv_tS9fQV5ESFG2N4U1mWtQwFRJwwUmQWrdxcHE6LXZfor1vyyj4oD77GmnQN79P0yLzQh5nyuWPS1EhR6Tj39P6cIuqU_dqXuXDbBW_Ak5s9TZH8fZkZ5BvKlE76kq3UPKGyos9KOA7cgnyECI8w0TIKEwTYDMWq-SbPp-p2K_jrQJUvs0UUhF8ICeScbZQMQFhil_yGVDkCQltsIzV8UtYWAX6vElIcjZQLsSMqcWB7OS5lNhtnaivEInNUNtzswgY68T6WuQfgACLbvVTIOrMH2bbVhBlBopVH4-7mvrbVpPO4fMgldCsr5E_FL2JndvCPvYvL29o3OJqVerUqHS2WwUXJXcquddXcRghJmVRaGyvbwqWlwXTKf_2jTaPsN9PvqwjpQlDLPzfdS_tAycD9kfJbBZG7til-3d3pMq2n3xiirVOC_WWxFoK6BKMHdZqTxsXy6vDC41-ACQFkcMpPs1RTt_VmQevXAJUGnV2l83GIYumfioui5aa4RmfC-iDrgXwleDQG_bTKAPBKhugKmlKIbqxU7ZiW3Xow1dCdbsKMV9D1OI-HRmvx8LjlsYVYyqMbtoEi4xNiQgqL39FB3R3Zi0tIJYpgkURBVdbJHLQZgvanMPX4pNAv3B_-rItRgmVO9FKdBY-g" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Portico of Octavius, Rome.<br><br>Portico built by Cn. Octavius near the Theater of Pompey between 167 and 163 BC, the remains of which are yet to be discovered. Augustus restored the structure, keeping the original name of the founder, and placed there the insignia regained from the Dalmatians in 33 BC.]]></description>
