      <Placemark>
        <name>Porticus Octaviae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7gU0PR9qiZE6ihMWjrzQE1PNdrM0rEriTWYNTQxtjZRJoJwhfI8tJFaTDCxszfy1R4T7efUXmO8t9Ztb_MMUaLrIYwo7rmuJS9WWtVXqJb85IaviZV61XlqpGS0WtV1HOnW1quHfoaKr9A_1B_9Gunm83vG2O2__6aICziGePdfIIq6dAvxA7jXnnZ5Hg8EMouSiONzAgROaWami_PQetmdmZa5I-agmL_q3M4u36GrUVpOKRqMVmhWn4cbSK0GJHhIjMT0TSjL-tmyH7eq3lstgucmZCLeBqLAyQ0Tv4fQqaOX7Y_-efvujsFqNEFA-LyGUVLuV9tN9wUrCl45kGJ7aeBCzgle_H4kkP14NQHneSsTLHA7USn9dPTsmQmoeiDG1S6LMmY5i4gS_d7Xfutb7riD0b9EGE0d_Hm53IqGyYkxvv7zp2AbubrvGz4a4dA7mv5uOkpzkTnyMcpln_xv6I5ZDD2k4hztm4IDyg0H8EqViIxoyswx166c2s2wHqFIilBcYKdlW2WI5OO0SIHyr9rjvEhYs2YrUtWWFg5h3HHByMX5seFmR9iNwTSggEzU_YIEEUD7TjbdqOjoqeD2kSf35XZPdwauVdkcgEFtm1fs0pBGd6J2naSuQVhPx871VBWMxb0-A0o6enI_8qkuIWwbDThTc3tdymdGFUgJCXh9hjkAtMEuldDPAqgHkfZ8YEoC2rzpg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Portico of Octavia, Rome.<br><br>Name for the Augustan renovation of the Republican porticus Metelli, which was located in the area of the Circus Flaminius. The quadriportico followed the NE-SW orientation of the circus and enclosed the Temples of Iuno Regina and Iuppiter Stator. Between 27 and 23 BC a member of the imperial family restored the portico and added a library to the complex; at that time it was renamed ‘Porticus Octaviae’.<br><br>Scholarly consensus holds that the porticus Metelli was built by Q. Caecilius Metellus Macedonicus in 146 BC around the temples of Iuno Regina and Iuppiter Stator. Remains of the porticus Metelli are preserved. The pseudo-peripteral hexastyle Temple of Iuno Regina was built by M. Aemilius Lepidus during his censorship in 179 BC with a December 23rd dies natalis shared by the Temple of Diana. It was damaged by the fire of 156 BC. The Temple of Iuppiter Stator was built ex manubiis either in 146 or 131 BC by Q. Caecilius Metellus Macedonicus; its dies natalis was September 5th. Rome’s first marble temple, it was planned by Hermodorus of Salamis.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4nUBDYX7gFLLsHprrE2NvZiM7GA-Kme-VcMiEaj9PG7qRBxNo2XLSJsHwOEmZEViw_gWr7rhF1jAG4nSTAwbLDlDMxpIGvDnc7ygzEJEaszGkc1sfb5fizEjzUIT0WxlU1GtDLCjsyD1qUJMVfssWdOg37j_Q6l53LVZmuFL-X-S_CPu3ME972DUkybpxQbSKhRVetPi9a-a_J5fgXEfDPUD9eTEC0NwzErh4-msU0Df-tNm2EFNNH9vvkzUNSTiRrrIGyoIdxYQvwy0lSHTqXTjkecRjV1yNqLXB2uT5y8-Kn0p8rgU6kS88A8WOV9S-SyjocXbOs1JhnZHLd-Qhq70mAe5v0aevM-y45mTLbVxkx7gRXT-yMld_9NaSV8pvq6v7XHyrUi6WzydKgx-crtwxfCJHYTo0F4SEEn4_dy0sBV-4_NzYgDJKsDQuGjfYcHTiWeEcqzik-mdgd7FE1PVzTAdXgdLC-Bido430_RnY4ESph1m2SQ6vMM3WS8EATFaTH1XIGHHckP9dL6qkZHCf5coMe6vAXx-syjEKAD3FRmbx34Y0gY1zGhbrrBAGgBqFTfS8_WpFN9gDEkiwaLYV_-80kst8bSjBp0JccwWhyP21DEuV2c5tliboarOWKkYWtl9iu6qT9i57YJfFhzEJhqgh2vm4_MwZkZt-A1qog5KOr0nNjl5zdmIqNgH3PI5mCTaRilw" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
