      <Placemark>
        <name>Porticus Pompeianae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7zBDbjH5_DCzXmdhvawR85zsE_b1wL4GSsHZPcGq3hP2YMeBwpnhl53jw-t9N1q7Gm8Om-L4lTOMuZxRoV9jnjrGx4jPc_OMtXYryRR4tYonmRHlohBmAjnqwtEnNk-xIDTBtYto9k3kM1-1lfqp12KxJomxBjOvpHT8FVjPSSdhERCrvdctbO8czj_fD5Sd3tO8o3Z0J_xosQpKBLWneUHULGHM2Rjt5f8Ega2ivO1llZ6zDlxXPl5sez7-6wPCWOinhDpvaBW5Q7UtuD3f0Jm1_Mq6wn-PkO5tTvlfR3MjDmZAY1W5YTBCC02Q7SEg3R1SBN075OfH5UTL6ROvQSSCPE93kJqHdOxRyExu-2h9NxDDyT32Prq3UhjNzBvgacNuWTqZhhuFR4_IzdSC2hqsBHM9wD98-l9dDVzdIbyg1cOcuICKFm1N-c1Ws7g0xtdFTA27BozYNG_0n63BvHC_0nsbRclPR4erj2-4RwbXAqpERpnRGwfeSeiQDBAXsapPa5BLWRdqkJRYxCNqnzVbW7qKLcl7hrZW_RlF2pm6TyDaKOZFLUjK8Xkxl8K6hTMMpdbMiVz0xHGHRud3ifj9K6aX1cVm44pAdw97p8s-IFhfL8junraUb8whQ8jgNkan_PE7H8BUySXB1OUzBkDxaMVERZ81bsw_SVEs-2flY95NddpGPlBfP5-3khxmwaeVm_I3xZFw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Porticoes of Pompey, Rome.<br><br>The porticoes of Pompey were directly behind the stage building of the Theatrum Pompeium, which was dedicated in 55 BC.<br><br> The Severan Marble Plan provides the general ground-plan: on the N and S were roofed porticoes, behind which stood the Hecatostylum on the N, and shops on the S; on the E stood a roofed portico, with the Curia Pompei in the center and a slightly smaller square structure to its S, also protruding into the “Area Sacra” of Largo Argentina; on the W stood the stage-building (scaenae frons) of Pompey’s Theatre.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxG_A9Fl_VKUd3boIf8jOQRfZq3l6sNuzV8iXVrD2tIA7ZdSrYMoEfFoPBobZvx2QrDNNNaGEPEERS0tvy0OLgeeNzqv0MHOLUIHOjWncOkhoNgi89mmm9_tYLgRLgyOcr1x57HP2xCGRNUeCr02rB1PIPkTX4O88FoEFTXhXMZcL4aPx6KxNQs7iJmFBOAkXGJmI4l3IpS8w?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1677-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7zBDbjH5_DCzXmdhvawR85zsE_b1wL4GSsHZPcGq3hP2YMeBwpnhl53jw-t9N1q7Gm8Om-L4lTOMuZxRoV9jnjrGx4jPc_OMtXYryRR4tYonmRHlohBmAjnqwtEnNk-xIDTBtYto9k3kM1-1lfqp12KxJomxBjOvpHT8FVjPSSdhERCrvdctbO8czj_fD5Sd3tO8o3Z0J_xosQpKBLWneUHULGHM2Rjt5f8Ega2ivO1llZ6zDlxXPl5sez7-6wPCWOinhDpvaBW5Q7UtuD3f0Jm1_Mq6wn-PkO5tTvlfR3MjDmZAY1W5YTBCC02Q7SEg3R1SBN075OfH5UTL6ROvQSSCPE93kJqHdOxRyExu-2h9NxDDyT32Prq3UhjNzBvgacNuWTqZhhuFR4_IzdSC2hqsBHM9wD98-l9dDVzdIbyg1cOcuICKFm1N-c1Ws7g0xtdFTA27BozYNG_0n63BvHC_0nsbRclPR4erj2-4RwbXAqpERpnRGwfeSeiQDBAXsapPa5BLWRdqkJRYxCNqnzVbW7qKLcl7hrZW_RlF2pm6TyDaKOZFLUjK8Xkxl8K6hTMMpdbMiVz0xHGHRud3ifj9K6aX1cVm44pAdw97p8s-IFhfL8junraUb8whQ8jgNkan_PE7H8BUySXB1OUzBkDxaMVERZ81bsw_SVEs-2flY95NddpGPlBfP5-3khxmwaeVm_I3xZFw https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxG_A9Fl_VKUd3boIf8jOQRfZq3l6sNuzV8iXVrD2tIA7ZdSrYMoEfFoPBobZvx2QrDNNNaGEPEERS0tvy0OLgeeNzqv0MHOLUIHOjWncOkhoNgi89mmm9_tYLgRLgyOcr1x57HP2xCGRNUeCr02rB1PIPkTX4O88FoEFTXhXMZcL4aPx6KxNQs7iJmFBOAkXGJmI4l3IpS8w?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
