      <Placemark>
        <name>Rostra Augusta (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5175x156b6n0CFzv075TzGsFVZNbY0wkcyDgkDXImLELhB2eV7cpbiC4a9AIP28oSqhjVWXa8WfvaTE8CIEKoQVBZjnYEfJ9ZTL9J_fp1lqj-cCSF7_1heyGZpylvoXjuQC8BPGbufWT3a7GUvVzaw-p26XyuSDqei3fmHUW2hk-4y0SPC-n7ToBTCYz9RQx7jCanItJ2N3tJZ3IBvZupe7o4jBSURh3U1OBEnzHTcveWOlhjGNZhG6azoBgdrK-YzlD1ofZSSXKA9iF9SQ8tYPQ31W81gPQeadh7lSO4bTUmXf7_zqVvlPFlfnDlpoF2_FbFxf0fjT74PjuXjWZVl7l1QLSyLHe3wrucCRXsa9GwI74M6dAB4BmZuV9Ow-5ghKRtzXAACb8RhpTnssnp7i6ECP96VNu9h-8_uUCw3EKVZWrw6o0_v1uFy4QDQRefQ-9YSE0fKK2NnLWv2h3Vj7cOsYqb1aE6e1f1ropWSLa-wLcYxV99m_4RO6pm6LbC5SnUEu0lSo-4tI1gmsizoXGUE5BAyUGB8lloK5nmM5g9XnBj4pqFQ8I6giPmyVr_Pgt6GLfuGOx_dm_XA0WWMbLOxXlY21Mf9ji2xyKgmaGPhnXcn9Nk7oBvnnHxpC9FSfZp-xf585T27pSHp2yH5hRTV3QrkNs9-HWQZv9pajwsfx3V_BHVgBHX_iXT6WyKqk5aH3A4e" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Speaker's Platform, Rome.<br><br>The speakers’ platform completed by Augustus at the W end of the Forum, referred to in the Imperial period as rostra Vetera. <br><br>The Augustan rostra, heavily restored but still visible, incorporated the earlier rostra that Julius Caesar had built in this area of the Forum. Caesar’s rostra consisted of a curving façade which faced the Forum and a narrow platform approached from behind by a stair of 7 steps. Augustus seems to have retained the semicircular stair to the Caesarian rostra, but extended the platform a full 10 m toward the Forum square, widening the entire structure to form a frontal façade c. 24 m in width. The Augustan rostra, which faced the rostra aedis Divi Iulii on the opposite side of the Forum, marked the Forum’s W boundary.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7WuMNfcXTGIXPN57bzKlMz8xMFRp91sIPdXlY5IpXZm4z2jSIz19SVroCNXK0LCGEfcOh4eD9uf6ma8QXh1fo2jIVNO_UGMnvpIqmInTm1gMPWyr2uKAKuKBFzvX6zDbzeELzuDnnBhUvjyqxZEj7vng2pQzRfKmfL-Q6iEvgGAgmMqwNioQXFiI8iteF23JSGG-WytCI7f4o3zSpdn1Rtx9NjMQxOqlNF_RNuOrspKmPxCda7urtdlrvV1zYWx1XLwSIFPpGF6QcoRm97IT3tionUh4_nfmhlS5dtaR3xcUIXXbs_FW_2DgNgRUfzavrfb9yCmeq7m6wOQS600VbSy5kY4GiT1yMYOa8jZvXaJKBjIrLh1oodk5k5AgVhYrmjc3sIpHDFZpnYup3Y_cBmdPIWiPoX5ufclWkxYsr3HahajI4nbjATiMymitkYcw1LiQmhCvvF5G5WQTiXsmAaWjOW1s48nJq7XmtdiFNQ7SfyMTmycyUu7DYpI2AtQPAyPhZHY-JayMuEF0FTJe33fq_g12Z44nrtdnnUtvGd_Scf6aqoJUf4J-Uh7p2JYaOJ3ltnp14B6hlkbk-r2BzBoFwjBO_937rcCZxhtadhZMbTrXMxCQzPtcfB5dbuVmtu86VhnMoqo0k9x7JsgXTsMdU85OzLrEsiEzasRys4S0Suq4jC6qJPSHSqnFsAhq6Xet_lYWMB" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
