      <Placemark>
        <name>Rupes Tarpeia (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4psyhX0XmKUkkYF1_LFg3-8Rr2C3jhOhMnRKA9CYFdTHxWV4rRQ_DIxUWR24veXa0J1OYoJOpelkkUlg-3-fGb5n3oe8WHN9NXFI_SF2lfdZwOFj7V99zSanvt-NGBFUfb4pjtCSFP7YGeXLgyhcLx6SHXE8cFVVYG2prK2WMfDQbyRbaxdxClngLMZU7eIJQ46fCXwaWgFT90u_I0El7if9ATlLugMBlnBtq-896ziSf2-FYuotJSxvUER08plG-DRDTTjqSJHxC861NvSJQ_t2OmKrjO_RGC8km3N-QHDzcjoBG9TTGfIydtjuBw2MVF7MDGHDSGDGgEx-7-GMbxvfHKGEIZgEOql6blpDCuPKH0CkPxK7LaH-BOSSqRg78ju8oaVDz-3C2SzdtT2w6FJ9zRfK-f6WhdsHQZtR_a-fJA7OHMCPRX-5sFGInyc7Mn-C7T4oAe-DGZmj7G_F5zv8Bq2xazEvbtCA-p4lZElfKecvaXgcvVi58N1gImavUF2JyHUlEU9fRzCfdrNFFJsPQsLO_s0By_duiqHnzP2o16Gr37XMRGtZ57il1-6TS_-eFwteO0wP0w2OOlVPkKhjkqZMMahwcBDo8fCQYdJJu07umF9hIYmWhcZdk4c7dtlYhIP2MVIlNKEGZge_DIzEUTU2e5iGLxHchKxnRxrpFY1Pg7MswXfYIkWOn2zCrLrRIBQY1I3A" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tarpeian Rock, Rome.<br><br>The Tarpeian Rock, also known as rupes Tarpeia, was a steep cliff on the Arx from which convicted criminals were thrown to their deaths.]]></description>
