      <Placemark>
        <name>Tabularium (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7ykoJ9ers7Prx4HVYPpCtx8OjhLbmnZyg1-MgCeJ4KWY9Sdfxwrh-8UE6x0SuABmVKpFScQufBGnppcQWxsSrZ1YV-t5UVnLcelVgZfiRlKr2BtpPZ2SBxxSZeuwMZqVNmHYtjWpBK0N3OjT64DrFWFSrwX2Z8ge-jE-_1wzKtKIa8v0y62YzjOaEoGhkbTv5mjVQ-xsxclDL1uyzyytO9JnOoQdEpAoVv7vyYsEu4s6ZCZ9wjwoQy4Gm3I8PZoyovuXYfKyHeORSNh_4uu8YttTjdOLg0i19Hpf_B4hK0OH3ifgZ_Iv0R_-AXG3ih4vYICqi-0YAb3KhskMBgilZfi-DRfUmbW1aUyAR9LgLQ3QrOgfNe07EAYKsODH-9Pdu7y6YHChAAv9ZC3uzj_hTxnYDTzsUzbTtZW_tGg2I_oa8phj0MnJHrO0VglBGZE93RtnPHvIh-SDhFbaOIu0QohoyT1FM6a3nC49KmGdpfgmQkj7nX7a3TeiT_aEB6kvmxU6DwoCsBkVsOGffuMCZrOm8hBgb291nRCGGHr-rDQf7Ph0W_NgsUlDYQ7b8qRqc2GRMDOkzPmWN7_LOUcm4SXk6e31IYVYcSNqTvvvhaWCGoIr6SQKgSgTWM2LjsgGRMlsHmc6aHN6D8P2mC2B_RsLVaws7rv5nVPLibc3gwLH5j1ugz9KpQHnkTcXUBG6imfnSeBBXzJQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Public Records Office, Rome. <br><br>The large, polygonal structure of the late Republic, located on the saddle between the two summits of the Capitoline, overlooking the W end of the Forum Romanum, is conventionally known as the ‘Tabularium’ (public records office, depository of the tabulae publicae). <br><br>The imposing remains of this structure were incorporated into Michelangelo’s Palazzo Senatorio, and its high colonnaded galleries still dominate the Forum. The masonry is dated either to the Sullan period or to the 2nd c. BC, but excavations under Palazzo Senatorio indicate that the Tabularium was built, in part, over ruins damaged in the Capitoline fire of 83 BC; its current footprint, therefore, was laid down after 83. This date is confirmed by the epigraphic evidence. <br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4ATCqZqPr7EIWon0CRRGPXyxayD2WI3OD6uwEjGHzit9R-kmSUSKal6qBZLvR0mZMEsgF9JzyBbpFGixUUNQsk61pIkjOpiFcfsAd_5dzOMYwq29L2D_qwImD0shIzKLD_YUnXZMpt0zLIik9MFLI7OxQ-Ph0PlLDr582NlfVbuRjHSdLrkAbcmIHYOXsPQmzmjH4IE_58tUGH093C_7YQcAnv8CRHokHyRZKeZ0SkAO4booVS3thlg-MWzIgv0vnWj-LCn8p4p-HyVa5-P8wOWpbbEqGSadPIJi3yp4ChHPHOdEH9uJ9R