      <Placemark>
        <name>Thermae Septimii Severi (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7sUUOKa7dg61rH_W3iIGXUoQLtnlIEU5FlOry8EbbROfmu3v1xOtoYKxSVkeTZjwpdcR25olJDiBUnWAYNaAsbCOiUzj0NfEd51LsRzpM6snjGFKqA9idAc4vwtgJ5Kno973yIxyBDfMe_u7p7vxOSINjCmC8SIna_WdKjwmBtsfDNoA383pMYQ385sfWJm1V43SSvPSc02H9m9O_XVyT9wm6mPTC-83ESNWONBlkIe83mrzT9f76HNxw7ociD13ayJ3nK42v-094ESscSH0SOjAZD7neHmXjsSJEZoU2mevqQUm6x70w6iu_wRY_dfQzrUaH2ZTsBezP2vITimfV-rQUWkjW5ZZxNSAXUIfnBHXrtoq9DGpZupMKLh0bm4OYV-wPn-yXAp-P6yS3NUXL8GL_dHCdesMR0c7qklHS3TQjGni1XS2SMDM02ra1CR4BNaKrPCbVGbw1rfzfqMS65McZawzrFf__ggVpRGM8qJaPev15e14JmIsbHcOQrpvzkIn6kkYyWQBAKuEFvrLitBZSv_l5mxzivYwoJ7IsIXmxZ0R1qCBEAfVZoMgijL9j185ziO2dZ8hX1dP24qffNo2mHZNqd-dz78UI2hvoxokf34qIMAwmnPXOw1ALCzqWN2TSOEU45SUz5YlgRnqBbGSQJGFPd5mXxBK_jhjomHu_zfkZXfoYTUC2ASk-YXOo-LXai5lZgXA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Baths of Septimius Severus, Rome.<br><br>They were part of the Domus Severiana extention to the Imperial palaces on the Palatine hill built by Septimius Severus. They were fed by a branch of the Aqua Claudia, which spanned the valley between the Palatine Hill and the Caelian Hill and whose arches are still visible.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw2WSjAxWOd6EtpLSlLu5-iVvVQVAc1rSKCseOG1zOsBzJZ3a5_satzdIFvEHXCxA18ZmWE-Ox7C8_kO9lmN2Faq-SHxSPdph510LJ5FyTSErluCXLYkAh84VQMefDlTZJe7F78rCld-rn1lx9Zms-Sf2ntsy1-7AcSIo88Ydu3uF6CN6v9twmDT1KW-bmmjnvFDPE31u-IuA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1701-673AB7</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7sUUOKa7dg61rH_W3iIGXUoQLtnlIEU5FlOry8EbbROfmu3v1xOtoYKxSVkeTZjwpdcR25olJDiBUnWAYNaAsbCOiUzj0NfEd51LsRzpM6snjGFKqA9idAc4vwtgJ5Kno973yIxyBDfMe_u7p7vxOSINjCmC8SIna_WdKjwmBtsfDNoA383pMYQ385sfWJm1V43SSvPSc02H9m9O_XVyT9wm6mPTC-83ESNWONBlkIe83mrzT9f76HNxw7ociD13ayJ3nK42v-094ESscSH0SOjAZD7neHmXjsSJEZoU2mevqQUm6x70w6iu_wRY_dfQzrUaH2ZTsBezP2vITimfV-rQUWkjW5ZZxNSAXUIfnBHXrtoq9DGpZupMKLh0bm4OYV-wPn-yXAp-P6yS3NUXL8GL_dHCdesMR0c7qklHS3TQjGni1XS2SMDM02ra1CR4BNaKrPCbVGbw1rfzfqMS65McZawzrFf__ggVpRGM8qJaPev15e14JmIsbHcOQrpvzkIn6kkYyWQBAKuEFvrLitBZSv_l5mxzivYwoJ7IsIXmxZ0R1qCBEAfVZoMgijL9j185ziO2dZ8hX1dP24qffNo2mHZNqd-dz78UI2hvoxokf34qIMAwmnPXOw1ALCzqWN2TSOEU45SUz5YlgRnqBbGSQJGFPd5mXxBK_jhjomHu_zfkZXfoYTUC2ASk-YXOo-LXai5lZgXA https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw2WSjAxWOd6EtpLSlLu5-iVvVQVAc1rSKCseOG1zOsBzJZ3a5_satzdIFvEHXCxA18ZmWE-Ox7C8_kO9lmN2Faq-SHxSPdph510LJ5FyTSErluCXLYkAh84VQMefDlTZJe7F78rCld-rn1lx9Zms-Sf2ntsy1-7AcSIo88Ydu3uF6CN6v9twmDT1KW-bmmjnvFDPE31u-IuA?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
