      <Placemark>
        <name>Villa Publica (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4YdPLONJaUQ4cwKNirZ2XwWFO_uHVZsi-EIeEJlaymrKgGmnAo4t8aGa-kSq_i3qA4qNz3MBOTmoNNl12wa1Bxo-kTG4eqTz0kSMi4FXUx85SGhnt8k_dxpsv5YOnSU-yhvdkXmCiH6cEQNaIh0vgqVhRGwe8DqQEDhtj52QxSBljQaR9F5QbgeI7LxXrwqKctjUHk3zAI0E_8ep4KhkMKCCJp26nXBzlcapSeMhbnguZVbGqUiNoGqLvvbEIiCIKgPqBrlkqciszGiCFs_bja3Am-Qvb7h1aO9P2_eGNZSWSFHSJOdWHUQEIsyRHcvluyfRtdRpOsm3UqtrZnN1oQQ18jD3IWgdWnUoNak39Y8eUEQLjwTpP1z6obnvFDI-P0iyyDnlL0chq3CLyYE0P-gu594joY1oVtT7j3vtEFyaSjFFzvbthInYjhZN7E7r0aX5aKdQ4O_xIrJ0DwYVZuDhGR75KBGO7QEdiSHZNFXfK_H89zaHr5gtuEdjdkRuicHaM1by8WNflLzc2wfn_8OFXUhuJNqnhpvBNNO8WY57m54X6aibDOJ2jPA7TMS8w2q9G1TKdj-rnrj6IMwcDf6XZXGfY9Vq6o_QkL5pnc9ayYtZoIbaaIEgRTpSjJEjc-ZmAf_Ek-0_55hrb1VOeC-NS4atNmuNKzvNEf3aSlfkXEKS6LmpEm6DcI4tlg7siNjnkMhohO" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Rome.<br><br>One of the oldest and most important Republican buildings in the Campus Martius, established in 435 BC by the censors C. Furius Paculus and M. Geganius Macerinus. It was not a functioning villa for farming, but instead a place where Rome’s armies were levied and regulated and where the census was administered.<br><br> The term ‘Villa Publica’ seems to have been applied not only to the specific structure but also to the surrounding open space, in which most of the business of the Villa Publica took place.<br><br>The structure of the villa itself has not been located, but is known to have stood somewhere near the Republican Saepta. This also served, from time to time, as the place where embassies from Rome’s enemies were housed. The building was probably destroyed at some time after 55 BC, when it was depicted on a denarius by P. Fonteius Capito, but before the reign of Tiberius, when Valerius Maximus refers to the Villa Publica in the past tense.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1834-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value>https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4YdPLONJaUQ4cwKNirZ2XwWFO_uHVZsi-EIeEJlaymrKgGmnAo4t8aGa-kSq_i3qA4qNz3MBOTmoNNl12wa1Bxo-kTG4eqTz0kSMi4FXUx85SGhnt8k_dxpsv5YOnSU-yhvdkXmCiH6cEQNaIh0vgqVhRGwe8DqQEDhtj52QxSBljQaR9F5QbgeI7LxXrwqKctjUHk3zAI0E_8ep4KhkMKCCJp26nXBzlcapSeMhbnguZVbGqUiNoGqLvvbEIiCIKgPqBrlkqciszGiCFs_bja3Am-Qvb7h1aO9P2_eGNZSWSFHSJOdWHUQEIsyRHcvluyfRtdRpOsm3UqtrZnN1oQQ18jD3IWgdWnUoNak39Y8eUEQLjwTpP1z6obnvFDI-P0iyyDnlL0chq3CLyYE0P-gu594joY1oVtT7j3vtEFyaSjFFzvbthInYjhZN7E7r0aX5aKdQ4O_xIrJ0DwYVZuDhGR75KBGO7QEdiSHZNFXfK_H89zaHr5gtuEdjdkRuicHaM1by8WNflLzc2wfn_8OFXUhuJNqnhpvBNNO8WY57m54X6aibDOJ2jPA7TMS8w2q9G1TKdj-rnrj6IMwcDf6XZXGfY9Vq6o_QkL5pnc9ayYtZoIbaaIEgRTpSjJEjc-ZmAf_Ek-0_55hrb1VOeC-NS4atNmuNKzvNEf3aSlfkXEKS6LmpEm6DcI4tlg7siNjnkMhohO</value>
