      <Placemark>
        <name>Amphitheatrum Castrense (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GyFlJ5mFH02u-s-co9E7VsWWmzkKA0VVAAIuif9l4nM5G3rEvR7t--4wp8QzarmhWux_kchlfxeza9p27-DeoYfz5woiqu3GCCc1MSIADoBv2PIc15hM4l_FzfoovmqixrqTheIa-2L7d3NeSu04jeDlMSBTYLQ_jtJnaS3x77ETov0c5NMKAOe20EmBU66f2QOGUb6IbdBNw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Amphitheatre, Rome.<br><br>The amphitheatre is dated to the first decades of the 3rd c. AD by the style of the bricks and the absence of brick stamps. It was part of an Imperial villa complex which was built by emperors of the Severan dynasty. The open arches of the outer walls were walled up when the building was incorporated into the Aurelian Walls (271-275 AD), at which point it stopped being used for spectacles and began to be used as fortification, and the ground level around the building was lowered. <br><br>In the middle of the 16th century the remains of the second story were demolished for defensive needs. <br><br>In the 18th century, a Hypogeum was found beneath the arena, filled with the bones of large animals. This leads researchers to believe that the spectacles here included Venationes, the hunting and killing of wild animals. Palladio and Étienne Dupérac made drawings about the ruins.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gxz1s3GOMX21eWiLotOHwSnHSray4998gJaXA-PogmvlBu9F6zVNRfZL8hzcAnhygneAyaFp6A_CFtXf91d9KCPXw52OyZWXlI0JQ6o1kjlKZGL9klUqwP_l9zC_z1mN7LTCnGoAkxu_6mlEKBwy3dJQ3Sdpe4lBL27_WIePnHiiog4-tjY-ZQShLoIjCROzOVKAQIZWOcpXg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxqAw11IvvcPU2E6qMLONhz_KPxfExxQrvoC7lqxsnxnIal5iZXPd03Sof6Jzk1AWL96juvbEWxbdCXRmBaN3s7RreLWf7pn6cfN427ZqAOxfgzq9eFvaTrNCqL4CKIKBhQyMGRVAzq5GV8F5TOymGA7vEQQsU_PS9N_EE9H8Cq83sIyQ8HOkU_M7b6JPiEhKCde5-m8AsKVDY?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzY2y5BYKno1ojvc5eL557srTVf5_NBO09tCbid9UKXF3slr3Z6NAbLsIDjNEs0unLQk0EXz0ucolBjL64f5rXEhnowjYtJjdDUSn0GRzcMI118hQytyLQrAj2IlhBdLUYrEyiPIUhX5gbMvioN9e5OA1hZzFH2zo59fnDmTmGaSDeZwsa9I-Zu5H2LVnKzNc089qhit-r1wA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
