      <Placemark>
        <name>Trigarium (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v70MvjyNKB5H46HSG1LtuHILDm4YTQr37fQNhd5N8L01WFruQnguJDAC5sO5FL_9muyzmteBNtS8VrkRRgbsSArQM2TY_PJeUSTmrSX1iYf9wUhp9IORcKi5jgXXwgD5i_N3Hx5irnsp1tF0Hed9YPfXrDZxllu64zL2XWg9KgffCUBiABLy1ZYwyBCkzJucgn0aCmarW2qJ2JIljFpAbPinzmtbUhP6DaYVw9QSkiZu_x7FDA1nkkFnFWcIeAUdoxpyFyJStzJJi4BEYdNSAYl0KyFEFw9dCb2F1jZWlq-_1AV-3CFhFnQzw0IBRCTHWZgLujU8H-F8SaXn_MS-GJ8UqHWgwswYJ7Q2oln6SAnZ7qQatfM5adgejtcNXIGE5Uqpzeeg0CD57Rrkgw-zb25yYNHF8kGQXiGrk95LpUz5JqGr0z2o58FBBI2krHZywgutJ8f9rZX--pCrxvAa1wrvUe8pGSITXthVYLnZ_oYKPa5rc5xokUIaW-Dl1V7J7rWK1SlsAFbwy3XJKoDWh7k0eb8FiURTjTzgZUV3Q3Cjp6P6JAT7bMFWINaTJqkyBchyG1ltMRV7ozP8KywiuqiAhMze95vx3caXfpaQ_LWE1N5mhskNZDzNpzklngZgsXjZGCAbLEsTSAIgFA7OOlaXms1rK4CUMlcDJwQuacz-E3p73dB_itZyc7iI0MlFsLJWG0R0p4o" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Race track, Rome<br><br>Horseracing track located in the W Campus Martius. The term ‘trigarium’ is generally interpreted as the racing track for chariots drawn by three horses (trigae), an event held only in Archaic times.<br><br> Nonetheless, there could have been a revival of these races in the Imperial period. The Trigarium served as the temporary racetrack (circus temporalis) of the ludi Saeculares to host horse races; it not only shared a topographical contiguity with the Tarentum but also a typological association. Perhaps other ceremonies of archaic character and involving horse races, such as the Equirria and the October equus, were held in the Trigarium.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7SbsyuUCOu3NV-mFHwgzPUdT8fGcxD7eokUWl9kpCg8BKt59CEGagi9_rH7oT7Krq9SItjwYgS7S5cWCyFWKXtuJSHYn0omDIRl_m1qgMijNq37WF9QujP3CxgG76n2N1lkQ-6kz31d_U1fgZwDdU7XJwTM1kXr3jianqPWPt9YrDkNYNS4BpgM8SsG4AVHMb9pBMcoypogMjorCzgn9e5tVVVJ6lPAMx4dfywnLeyDk817-MXZrTY_SpLCMeyO0THSGuEIwnd87Kez4uRIWZRtiPdmPf_Sppl9wGRH3Giao6cN5eYUHHPLt3wGiFubtGSTKj1KRPx2DSa57qbNLtKK0gAVqiMoEuSKnUkerFiRsjc5rB6x2BCN8lHrW-fkDWbHLTwZx-rP_ILP2q2RXUuxWIyPG3_bfMtdKgZejqmypTL9uSQAqdwcmvnW0PHfoNLCgBxSCY-dOsTou3flS1UGhfnYVOkwzbDWLHiahupohILUeHAmbVwB_SsLPmYXNUubITvj-wLuP7uVuTXJGGKGCOEY5UfQwTjDHOWLqiCG4Oihvj-Bmx2pjgGU5OqeywxzR-WJhwY5BbSmiv9JwjEMY8UYFte3-bPzs04GOetVvKE5MlY4v7q070akRd1N15HkcSLvJ-Ezsr234wBDamLqvTGlmWyvyehEpRZKw7BpZAeqPsZoeO0EyG8B2cmsjxlGO92HOoE" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
