      <Placemark>
        <name>Auguraculum (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6azIDKnJ3qy3LAdHKH-EsCrN8R_XPUI-DbBY7q1LUsK7zzKky8_kJD3Gy-42LfBDo8tb1NH_r5J45cKi6wO--a6InGtFuIimr7vpIvC-P6jlLddW8FfIY08Qrn90YkZht8MLuzCkKJzYQ6ZLF8x81ZnLI3NE3VlFM8quKJQp90FopM7yKCc97VIY9GtkMA2t8kGu6xikwVfdOC17bbPFF-K9xB7qHcB9dHQlC9etS2u2BqF4SStoc1pbMBdWn6XtHa-391RAZMy2_gSjX83Uk95pJHNbtu1FcF1QC53aM0PILBnLwSvSFfEIc4TJ6oEcVgw0JNkEt2iGMe-XY_A_phxkMX8ylwQO_km_5UtuMFcNTqlC4rdbu9FBsUklWEOSQy7NOmoijV7havOinvK3zsVev7k3gFzDH_Hr1IjHeNkvzwqaloXfK_CDEhkva2jQKTs55NaBs6bD4j_kiObP62x7SCxHsGCpkLitN78e8rcwvPNYm6fT1CNfybWF4rNtYKUr3VFgZtZ_p09IKKod3PaL6-PfI_Su6rSNajY6HRL3ca1a6GXyNgnaq225evLT8owbW5XveEdYxcDFUwsfYTa2K2k4XO_Y-klCqnBzVhQ1B1PgtSCPmCt91DsxbdylA6S63hAflJWMcSJMRR0OI_wqDnuGpl5BlCyASlnPXdaXjjbLJ_NmHW4cpNS2mkanZJ67Q-ZJnzTg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Augury, Rome.<br><br>The Auguraculum was a spot located on the Arx, in arce from which the augurs observed the flight of birds.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4zdSwutK4X5cxMVzwrbKxgf1hc70zcWENNIHfVpeMuMM8N2vSwksSJDSFrylR_WQtcgepECJ7tjl-ABJFEsd5mn-7m9xcEqx0asiylQiXoDUlqADjrqVIwBLhKrAUz0lb8k1X7Htbb5nz5fz2tJDX7LWstd2ElW5i7JK-YgEktRl1F-HljgOSgBVhB8AtFZOfS64H2iC4jbiGRPwktjz3Cs0l0EpzSfc-tmytIPeFa3fjtJ30Gj7Be55Wg3fzNrvbcNu4i38jMONDeq8KHt_cd7DnUS461FV744XKHsmJjlXafjGaLY8PrhwSQcKRLd0QB8rMQP61wMn6YX0uoxDycRDU8OS-g-fuaxEmZ9mpJioq30nAoGCojZdB5FTRH3ZHenN9Phd0r0dt4_SZlg9QFLOlDgkrVbIirZfmKGAXHdlj-d00uNPr4v3NRiYum3bsZrE1HIOhpZIKcVQEWCneb5_vouwuTdLTZCsuYeT_LV4n-VhdoqIX963FPgj1FoApCLEEZPpVZVnb36WgxhYwcyMzaEgof1b_VNQjrfmjSdLOV8fiXm3BOjKtEOYeoZcvkoaZs6izSlFbi3LwbCPv-cvh_QCKzVbIbL8r1ozxwe3WDB_ApIyksXwzgBnWJq546OqdgFT73_2cSdsNXWqWRuofO1KeNgBCmV5MUY_jUP23v5ib7YAVOkbR7gBuj--FuAuIb6_Hx9A" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
