      <Placemark>
        <name>Lupercal (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxxkWyLf9_4GWp0hwVNqIwiOxgQWG9jU-I1FPxY1BRLnA29sTx9ntfvYUopsLKmGL2r8LYPWaAnK0Y77aDVuK7233ME6l2Pd7BwCkjk7qTN7-Z9k2zg42mOtAHhnDr5KTEg8tFWLD1CiYCDiOhhfQgssqxzCqtJu9z8pEVOfA_sU3gsN5QYvHDU7h7oooMMqk5T-IY8CXY7uA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Cave of the she-wolf, Rome.<br><br>A grotto at the base of the SW Palatine, near the Circus Maximus, believed to be the site where Faustulus discovered Romulus and Remus with the she-wolf.<br><br> The site featured a spring, and was once surrounded by a grove; the original ficus Ruminalis grew here, but by the Augustan period, only vestigia of the fig-tree remained near the Lupercal.<br><br>Following literary sources, the Lupercal can be located on the lower SW Palatine. Dionysius of Halicarnassus places it at the foot of the Germalus between the Velabrum and Circus Maximus, and also associates the grotto with the Temple of Victory, which stood atop the SW Palatine. Further, the Lupercal is described as in Circo, and used as a landmark for a Palatine theatre proposed but never realized by C. Cassius Longinus (c. 154 BC).<br><br>Augustus takes credit for building the Lupercal; although what this meant architecturally is unclear, an imperial intervention would have entailed significant alterations. Concurrently, the festival of the Lupercalia was reorganized by Augustus. Within the Lupercal were several statues, including a bronze depiction of the she-wolf suckling the twins and an equestrian statue of Drusus. The presence of an equestrian monument suggests the change in atmosphere the Augustan rebuilding may have brought to a once idyllic, watery grove.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzPYTF4PCb5-Zuv7pWtHmLF_ZITNkyH_EfFKyTHSL0qQgWYbft7YZ6FnIcXm76OJeN7vWL7U3gOcnbourqPzTn-G4n-sY1PG3EyhYFXQNqFCCYcSubWw7nReq1IGX2EvGv-5IF049BwmpzThpSOtg_Y1KJaiivtGnx0JCvDdz3cem7CV2SkQQL8rNZpUtjOyHHTNyGUESNePA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GyPuDH6PlecpLsP4359kBuX7R9VsP2dfgyjfCb2z_3gXvezCfQA9937eqX_JctkKriJXo9DR2Y-CBUTraP9aa6_ksoQF0qj2re-8Lk3QdQqBuj68BmiaWWDf3xl5vZdWCr09Kr8zNVEZ1OZoXcalhjYLAD7BSm9_YWjMB9bpYPJKqVI72wDSq7qgFzszXoJnWRzMXPcGEcCCg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
