      <Placemark>
        <name>Mithraeum (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GynsnIYXVHPzOW3f-8Et7OKwHzAZ0L5DE6SDlz27dBBel1uv02x715TZVkrRP3tqIzo9ijeWzUXDq8ifx2s1MyH8UWV5OEKoHP-W0OrjxW50BxqGQNfShIU_hclFqZyjAMZzmk3jxJD2p8dPpDAgpsw9jy8yQvqg4b-qCm5dZ1HpygTbwwxiNSpB2qsxFY_iGmjb_-a3YjiKw?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Mithras, Rome.<br><br>One of the largest Mithraic temples in Rome is hidden next to the Circus Maximus. Discovered in 1931 as part of Rome’s fascist-era building projects, the small subterranean space was once dedicated to the mystery cult of the god Mithras.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzVm4ODLKBI5wvWVqrPAYm1CshtfHEE9FqmW_NOW8bJsgC0W6wXwb9TOI_6PdagOPtO5RMPjGGBvDWxjXT3OYPYaJgozvVf6bqCNEj138cubuS7bbXWxB3ZRSoF0V4parGyBv0sK8MBp1LE2s4uzm_xk731H8pMCH1jbxy5lwWW2zWGRrsE-PyPD5qXxd6aR-Ac0q1YirFQUA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzkUo8ObB8UE-wud1suQSQA7x5gk4y4_MOGn62NmbOPdB2ax2Da1M2bDoiYlS8nxm1J41aLhZWrDaDj_uszn23hbBMtBHPnjdFeXzmR-SvrKfXpARL8a8DnWQezPlTJJn8MfnED4-2YUS2JxfA7g2w6A3gCEQDlYSkHE81JW0zR3-9GgXEmFpcYb8nE3Ai-QJJM_xR3Q6SPHA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1548-558B2F</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GynsnIYXVHPzOW3f-8Et7OKwHzAZ0L5DE6SDlz27dBBel1uv02x715TZVkrRP3tqIzo9ijeWzUXDq8ifx2s1MyH8UWV5OEKoHP-W0OrjxW50BxqGQNfShIU_hclFqZyjAMZzmk3jxJD2p8dPpDAgpsw9jy8yQvqg4b-qCm5dZ1HpygTbwwxiNSpB2qsxFY_iGmjb_-a3YjiKw?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzVm4ODLKBI5wvWVqrPAYm1CshtfHEE9FqmW_NOW8bJsgC0W6wXwb9TOI_6PdagOPtO5RMPjGGBvDWxjXT3OYPYaJgozvVf6bqCNEj138cubuS7bbXWxB3ZRSoF0V4parGyBv0sK8MBp1LE2s4uzm_xk731H8pMCH1jbxy5lwWW2zWGRrsE-PyPD5qXxd6aR-Ac0q1YirFQUA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzkUo8ObB8UE-wud1suQSQA7x5gk4y4_MOGn62NmbOPdB2ax2Da1M2bDoiYlS8nxm1J41aLhZWrDaDj_uszn23hbBMtBHPnjdFeXzmR-SvrKfXpARL8a8DnWQezPlTJJn8MfnED4-2YUS2JxfA7g2w6A3gCEQDlYSkHE81JW0zR3-9GgXEmFpcYb8nE3Ai-QJJM_xR3Q6SPHA?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
