      <Placemark>
        <name>Sacellum Veneris Cloacinae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7xQcIAzAReAHenjR4tpWf63umh5ZAtr5y_eqJrOumMRjHnkxuC1SkhcZrWvjHo9TC6cbmJLC0xTePlLZigfikf0kbHSsN3-UhWfPVb71hbQ-_q3Q7QU71MOe1U24xoAjIhmPomsAxl3_RcJvnqHd6ncxNVBuyG1G4Zf2Q7nLvNFrev6v_KmymCcDET5Talhj_Dqpvz9xk1uXpa95mw_BEbXuD6bI7jhZdIEGhEVSjOy94k8KZ5WKg7822QDs7gp7IYl2ShoF1Rqyl72CNiI5FDrjz2ZssMA8xElyORdRVgAcgvo3mBM2-81whUenA_9H8veUCp1FTzcv1yVFRurmWVgM_uJaR1dY4_OvmbJrE3nUjwjxI1sWhixkhGq5mYCYhISwyl_X2WpW6K1i10Ag4_wltqiKO7DEHfqi3Mjrd6i-3mN0-SI55qjxtq7tmBvIT-HqvNZhuOG4ZCyi-JwUTW36ezI5YIytykljXpFslyYhxlJMY22_2QhQ0XdyE4HODIfr0Ii5IM3qy_CllTgswJoPftA9IkWsbWpSLubCjyhLO31XX9Yy6vrgKbuON9jjDI5VudwQJNK8ci8v4WOerjPgf5hkGddBB6xlbNo8xohD7cR3e3mMMdJhck02LPaa6wI4P4eTAZOoS6jCrVfpmGtEuX58sTJ3wbZJUK72dcjFI688rYK3BqSkGXhe2aYjIo7K3NqbNuzQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Shrine to Venus Cloacina, Rome.<br><br>A small, circular shrine in the Forum dedicated to Cloacina, the divinity of the Cloaca Maxima, later identified with Venus. <br><br>It is first mentioned near the beginning of the 2nd c. BC by Plautus. The shrine, depicted on coins of c. 42 BC, was located in front of the Republican tabernae novae, probably at the spot where the Cloaca entered the Forum, and can be securely identified with the circular marble base discovered in front of the Porticus Gaii et Lucii.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v446b3G0ZLQD2fsJmH9zhzyL60zG3O6kZHlh052iaqXW5ZetxIJoGfgR0dQu-BfAIHQ9jC6FKXW4LcLVpANA3XJWXov5akjZX_pFklJQ6mzw_SWKoIDXKeRWnX4IXIWMxm1xBEJpzVT6d81Dg3GJWkSvntgHTVvxejhoj4xIcYZn1LQWOqQBON4YzEaglvt3ljm0f2-DGP4SPeP9KP0N4b5O1UEMw9bDI4bYCbmmFfYtTSP8E0JBal1czCdLd1HfTYgw2YQuW-W_VPVvy0TS9DUYzFNZfs5bgz8jTGsLd4hgi-YrGkVyh2EKKQZIWEskvtyRtf-UonC4QOa7cWh_KWf9Qs4MXlXzYKsSfTUUNK0TnQd0LVAdVJYTG3M0fk8fBqPx0BD1Ra7qbTghbDooPxNRlFZgV6Fzg5LJipTcIzGH4I5FLbtqoFY9DsuXA9XVnyeRcZElcgpYKP3w0GYQrDGkgG9gwWCRvgdxPecrGqZLk-NuaKkqyVOjbqpLC1amijZIMTzoZfi0ZxChSYudRpq4jtLbRwNZWLBUaDeBUTKBxhsYQIeO_EUtuTG1iJ3bEMghCWSP2Z8ml18