      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Fidei (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7g1OHVYpQN9CU47muDTTzI8Zalot73qb4XkRW5SG8SLiO1nA36psYHdQ0WQtI1VVsOprL1mGKTJQwAXFxm73DpoOtZEgdFXcMPnl6pHSKZyCIExXKcGJkiEQY0Db3n28Pa4RmNfXOk8j_XY_a8owhPu6pAxhqugCdzaNw-PJ-4oURmO8gqSl7u-tMi0e-Z1djLKhO-Xc1C76FCJxoGjnPBtKjEykA0WIQdTmbm9lfQNgJjwFFbviKK1_lUDQN0Ga76uyMifUwRNqMUIwa0OGZxft90S85icPuQtgO1DnFXsnfdEtXHY9LYb8jZr-bL7GdS4SvlpfwUsMs9DryAkIwElBj5v1I_DinLuZ-BsvSRh0t3d9BRULm1D2H2QVFS7n2S9xqwSg9JfNAKB0d2FrlYZM6FVvjgRQMt1XvsNJ5a-GVwpSyt4QGWq4kKz-nAutGVjwoO4OVM3vLEUzE0hVpq1jPcfrJyZKrLY8nLtNQUr9Nn4fR-9mbVXlwk0kle0RmUEsSe8E8JMIbsEztArglUJsl5w6x4Cch85j8_QRkCz01T10UuJQ7n_4g8o7XmL-JNWN10skp-KzrMkso-XE8lqF-McVip8kLGtBZd1BdjkHUpsUXeec6PlWJ3-FXUYY26uWdNWsIl29SWrYpNQ50-Yifv9yEGf3GVaqm7NLXHHMCUyAxZRnpyoO4diuS_t6waBBte6uwJ6Q" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Fides, Rome. <br><br>The Temple of Fides, also known as Fides Publica and Fides populi Romani, was built between 258 and 247 BC and rebuilt between 115 and 109 BC. It stood in Capitolio and near the Temple of Iuppiter Optimus Maximus, hence in the Area Capitolina. <br><br>A military diploma set up ‘on a wall behind the Temple of Fides suggests that it stood near the outer temenos wall. It may be placed on the SW edge of the Area Capitolina on the basis of archaeological remains found in the Piazza della Consolazione and the Vico Iugario. These finds, which are believed to have slipped down from the Capitol in the Middle Ages, included the base of a statue of Fides and fragmentary inscriptions of treaties of friendship and alliance with foreign communities; these were perhaps originally posted on or near this temple, for the goddess Fides took treaties between Rome and foreign nations in her charge.<br><br> Architectural fragments found at the foot of the Capitol suggest that it was a large temple, with a podium at least 2 m high and with dimensions of c. 20 x 30-35 m.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1548-795548</styleUrl>
