      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Fortunae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4ZBx10HOO1RsbJaaEQaDiPt_rMS6cJWPdMJrVkGZO7Y8PO_owL7fgVp7IMLVZgWtmAR5YAvp9rESdcDviSI_QZk1JMs5EwN2ba3_TxBckT9XsOphY7xJCvIyedlTwGQwTP12mZFhd93L_Ua9Gq-LxHpuJca4S9WZYdWeLCvd8Z_JYTmQROPhC9p-93425pvgL0nOpRSO5GxYbOqTwAJrISp7npegXRvwtWCmKzjgRh-vutK_MoRd23NYIjazkQSMnDh32C3b4jFgy7kKCTeN-b1mu6YncnyhJm_ruwOJ-5pceXmkKUKI5lH5wK_Cg7SuJwOsV5XcWKw-sNmz9BZt0rnz1raYUcAp2zVgeLJZC_itGrGq5stEvqrIzsxt6T2iwl8OdkuXI1YTcwR83UrUlR8l_J1FVGKNpa0n5Kdy_qymuwUWr5BHe0YbFeUtuYsITJ75-UFA181uZLnBgCxCgP3JSFgju1FGT4T8ZZY9zGAcHvrhmamhqXVo3psYjJXKy_sNTwXLd5VeKAVffuLoPqD68bpCkg_E4TUz9FaP1Ziwm28TsaoKshW_qpmO2h8QMlFH122R9_U0XQwuJiBy1sBxzwxbxESNjSm-QREpowzicJ-a0j7_I7HJlGwmI83-P4RQ6pznqf5TYRPqSQ_ZTvIEuKjH6lyNQF1uKQ8giRL_zO0FnFi1ipPG-95NBLAUqRLQQqj84dfw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Fortuna, Rome.<br><br>Twin temples dedicated to Fortuna and Mater Matuta located at the N border of the Forum Boarium, just inside the Porta Carmentalis.<br><br> Tradition held that both were founded by Servius Tullius, and the temples are often mentioned together, even sharing a dedication day. <br><br>Since both temples burned in the fire of 213 BC, which also damaged the Forum Holitorium and Porta Carmentalis, a location in that vicinity seems likely. These factors led scholars to identify the twin temples discovered in 1937 near the Church of S. Omobono as those of Fortuna and Mater Matuta; further, archaeological evidence dates this site back to the Archaic period, which corresponds well with the tradition of the temples’ foundation. The temples share a single, large platform and each has an altar in front of it. Under the nave of S. Omobono is the aedes of Mater Matuta, while the temple of Fortuna lay further S. The visible temple remains seem to belong to the reconstruction in 212 BC.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5OBr760DRKfnaeycwyj2LjQsKIqrjPlVtJ4xtbmK5uswD9OYfmWG74ej7lSr8QoL2d9TOf0YCPKSAyUCrydrdbODeKqPB2dWWC1ML1qz-I3n88WQoL8WFa4xSMgdW96eJqcY9T65Bgq_3U2nXwmqGjM98_eWs1BxEOR_QvBkjO1n5HWwoYMxj6v-TVJPCnUV_VTK2bnQ1CBY_OAKFHQ2z-o2Hxr7JlTQGrDkCPO8vJkeI9YimHZcbOEYoIxr23Klaz_-r4BPMhYEOtH1xqB6ex0fudRBVuAF-xRYY2cUv8hOb87Pj0VQqIGt7bjSn_JWx8PYfjzt2QEwkXBW8PpVeglieqEp9i7Tj7rV-5TeGLp7z0OcLF0MjWH_R1VXP12st8kvBMhmyuTiXWKj1bpDyDC112YdYhadPrn6vboHCfPlcBCmYb2sQ7Hr-od9s33xlT_kY2vi3Httcw1NPdzvHjx16pSSKaaa_DMZ3VuxNZE5JY5enTcA5vJ6m9bBRel86FUsDxiFOZk0ijlN-n_vfOlb1Qj_a9ihNAiucLBD6KAwbC5orX6LNb7jP9FSe2XswYeBSOiG6GgjtxjpVl3-Jq3joVBcHUkBZ3ClClkqf98J5_9SiruKohrVLd53VupND3c8jIxlxAFpXENgZqhIkWHALPt5Cj-xfFQ9sMbJTnLgqVQdkWmybhxQTnRT25ITDN7gLEuc0Sig" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
