      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Iunonis Monetae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7d6Ys3LAkB3FE-26N-eE6F-qqSVzLPtY0JAh-2pLoawJOucbyHgKdAFBDedrdyVbBp4pPHMmyMSFKvJZgotzTpCG3nd0NAEFm6G_tFg6FQimZ7b71jZy-C9of3AwapKV-u2LXST9Zv1d9YNbZBBbmNsledODZdpWn9FqMbHgrHiahxj5TQzLXAGw6EY4Ub0lzWY0UnHhL2rtNtirX7z7PHoyy_fSuTzcFpx45Xv_gx_ENkCdeErmGeghMHCD8-FlKuaOrwvSzVxLHnVRsl-_ERgGN14zTrYDUTMPUBOY6p4eXEjdvoiGvIAfZhlkI7i6LYx9fz00ziI82oSx58cSte9_lf4or7sjHtBN5FIsyO9XJK1CXszgE4_L1q6nxKCmvjR7SI2KnXtopGLarqifaezfJQCKsl2L30IlRpkQ5pow5h05CsGnS05aMiGHJNr6hzkMl7rGauY0brdYW9z8_BWXDWB85Y6BOqRh0_aL0Ru37a-YNISHJcD5m8IoaaccP9uX_FPD-cbbohysERrdkszuPMW2jJIgT7szxI9oBHhpx8xelbfSveTsB4A0GzhbVX1I4NEUI778BOLEE4vG0ULnA2CH24y8_J-brQ-w0vRPh26bFfalCu7rUKp--_lRxs7YzCojZQxhM-cGzz9xCjN-cs173ds84DxVyeDaoBGrL8gDY5kpFZpYJoWMc7P3tHqjREc2-lmA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Juno Moneta, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Iuno Moneta on the Arx was vowed by L. Camillus and dedicated in 345/43 BC.<br><br> Ovid states that it was located ‘on the summit of the Arx’. This puts the temple under the Church of S. Maria in Aracoeli.]]></description>
