      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Iovis Tonantis (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4K6wC0h4jO_yw_0Fii8dWW64dh1tdfFWAramRfMwHVrAtEuE0EwYwiFibh_v1u6Yd9fiLVdMb48qcnPESIJUbgxaXwByT3sQZCHUUb9PZx8wU3wh4nelXdGZOzJge8PR9m8tTmlMzkXQVNJY0nOn8M1kASpQ1C790XPP0AWW1E4m2Lg0xj05uQfp5qep5YTazDGyzF2MHx6gqlQjJYDwrurE8fgTA7_A-eLnBq2QEDr2zB8to8GvJ77Qe2lcribjGCCY8n5ernNmGujXMMEoS8Ez8R787uX2Ya8dIky-0qXM5VBFgP1F0IPs0hgncB-tOO_7Sg_7M-6tHZ1CCKsbbOXxQGhpLGKEbADw4uT3W8j1RHAYptdf9WEX509q9BclcwrSbclkxk9K40G1f2v78KdPy1gDUEX5tm5CDC9xbcJ4mMppsuRVr1NGWClJuDl_qDBrUvqCNgfI8osrXVqVukCdIH8PCCskjY8jO9wvizEHmVpsZ92Kzaw2DFHBXikoEb6xHqocVlrEOpy2IHQhQr-5eFM1nAz6OQ7U-uJgwi4kEKrhEaXKih0nWi2SH-vXu9q6EsS36KPhA1dArtcO8PfzgLBc0RrUBXiI91i-uirctLk6z4NPKC6cC3D-fuQhcncapTKha-_tB41xJbS9L1Tl5flztUJDTXR6g7BM2Y6QUfeJerFMLQ_3vN48O_k4uEOAoOIUtxrg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Jupiter Tonans, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Iuppiter Tonans was vowed by Augustus in 26 BC after he narrowly escaped lightning and dedicated in 22 BC. <br><br>It was located in Capitolio, and is humorously described as the gatekeeper for the Temple of Iuppiter Optimus Maximus. It is thus generally placed at the entrance to the Area Capitolina at the top of the Clivus Capitolinus.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4IIXI1eeaBQ3_RUzktC8dVtzPSaXcj0V5b77xsgbKyzGz3Q1xrAHZ81d8rUQS51jJLpY2n6OsvDNFGJF0rdcMjQmtWnq3RBtV7t3q4_qFJ99vw2uBBd1C3m5oWq4qrC92AJVI5kaN4FGCECQtfbwcKGKbZQkSrBPgffAQgZ1L2PgHq-jBgb_7BkUIsBji0xDxfKepipDT9IKWqlbOk6pQEIeYvZ_pPy3tS96us19-W6vz6OmVz7xz4nbsGm5Segv9Fqn-2f_vp7i-yf4siyFpXXorQ88s5kEJ88jCrmhJZSl_FG5Rbx1ULrfL_WtYjWrEVC4QEqHsh4bJugFCGrHKkrUQ0Dn7HyZHdpXzef_fNWVyrWci1yo7d8bItiWq2QrzM_VijdhfaQiooe29J5P-6Pt4Y8bJthpi7XQXreDT6D_lHuvZ3nL2UnPpyPS5ECOpLJEQDUWLKcX6jK9Gjst7llFFbdKmh2PjjnDs4Q8L8-Aw0Juw9jhtzkU_mOPfyyxGr8kA6hZDo7yuwVK5KEQ2CUcEWtbfVgON56PpKHF1wDSkvu0Nv3vtJOtC_0f4NwXBThBUTbx3pjAPigTNO-2_PLsfE0WDyae1HqgjEv8hQEGfi3JYO6yz3IakeZEFteZA4ELDt9LzfLcuLllLVLBfLB-y0nsoWficslJCIwlDXl37pWwO4_Y7Dhwzd5xroVHIRcrJeUdbQ" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
