      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Matidiae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v68QThViwMq_C91pUNRwkpqgSTdDi6y14vlHjCQOpKpbp1ZSkgWvs3Oxwr_iNNLxlem9ByEZHkWZ7emuKcohCSyE0k_jBOesQ43nhdre4CWgMEAFSh91GcwWN50vEyaQtyxHOUUZQl2jfs2AYXhCd1FRiYU1leXxuRkQM8OQEYc3O3fZyTaKNn_SxaJk5gRckmSOT2M4-rfLGu3b3kB1P6RR2VFH0bEeuNrDJ0gzDWPVQY1035RryzGqFDw5VW2N9jM4yF72Yuiotep5Af8D8JrWfwvY-hTmYXi05IboOjmt5m3keZeE5-dNTdkN6H02mt8RZBgEtfb9FsKcFwXgNl5N39AkvtT3SfsEGj2eBkRKU-aTU-KWCjoiLRBmE8G-oIsVyfS_NTSBoja40rOwBtJnJIa7d2Zj8IsqcCLIIC4icx1ewhVe5-XHbpA-E0niOAX1yc5zenAK3elS23r_OSNdLLHKhupl3kIXLYryLY8jTwQsnGGKtCSuYxO2IYm5nk_T26rTgUoZtPFrsVsw_R7Bi1FAb8GhlvdB3aH5G_No-Uh2AMPI3J-32pH2GtPXEIhBMVY-TTuZoCY0OtdmEUOOyLlQpnzW5DDbaGM4cwxs_4i3_vEZLQSNbS-MMKrD-uVEucH0DyLx2hShQpMNYpA25b-D7crjjUsK21EjjPxqrT63D8gDWsqMfG3g1u781mDwsxjon3OzA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Matidia, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Matidia was a temple on the Campus Martius dedicated to Salonia Matidia, who was deified after her death in 119 AD by her son-in-law Hadrian. <br><br>He began construction immediately after her deification, choosing a site near the Pantheon and the Saepta Julia, both of which he restored or rebuilt. A lead water pipe inscribed 'templo matidiae' ('from the temple of Matidia') was found near Sant'Ignazio, which may indicate the temple's location. After Hadrian died and was deified, his own temple was built next to that of Matidia.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6brECq16t3bPtZ5UF362nrjLPyE32ZAKbcT4e706r6YbShCrFtvWAYLRT50C4iIZosHjas31gfQy6c6KNsyNDTEAGvHpFVK36EayVPd8BwWj90DDcVECEhEurAxC8GtTXVi-VuUo6heakyumk_xAbj5fKmqlmhV6ssBZlonmKgWwzWUA1ZsvGoaHXR9WY5W1jyLic8ctZoN7QunZGqjrAW5jPdKPQr3QkgPNgzgUhdsHAlyzZIiRS3O7bN8YMWJk2XTskQiNiup6pvDx3YfYXPxDDI9-9A-hJTztPQAtub29fnlraX3jjbvYbrglRg-9TBUWFWooWPSnA981MgDe5ym1vVvGjDhMTPDFBYXQhQ1mc0L9TPPq6ZPoAoss1aMAsJnCSlIXabalb29O-Y8hb1CO5Ema-EY0u0nYHxdqlweBaeJh6KCvYpMdDlJ7p5P3cmjS5XtnY6lVnci7UNiCzXhmVm5OREVLRNvTXnVEdHwEgkHkVfAarUgm3e0NxC5tt4ETvU