      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Minervae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7cvWDE1p_8zdGCcqaKDSJbYY4uB3xX9tcP6qSUiPJ8GOcVwvvRqZAfjtp1v4iwM8RFxJGBCMoyhDbwTZYYt2tp-BOxmmzHlWpjeO_YucKkETAAHx-jXlfRjIu7fR5lQU3mmfjhN8Uka7jx0Ygnp0itZDQyaTBWsOgT-PT38YbNW_W9FgJmMwCZ5ZBIcg6rtrqVbfSdv0mD4bHxMo1UoGgHoIBhvU6hjLwoORCWxaCMtGMDkPQuLXhsBmlyKs90EeBKkGK-ZALdiKtmDAmfmbnPwDJz6KABoDBFuVYouBS28Yy74S_3xS2zphEIns5ahrZlpGAdtkPj1TbmOMbDDnjHm7QSjCKoLzFpycv5x2BZjwHs68vV5G0FBRq4dPTdwWD8pf3KtWk4usHX89r6vCNto8MNI6gKwE8wS8-2PC4Cz9PfUH_JBi4DbAbUPwNfrwTLm46lnGseZgSK6UzkF0CGP_A_dU2jl4OAmTwKa0G7LV4vrPr8NDjbJL_cXoK8vDoJOtSnnO1KwsBiIKLi-gTDHju2miwwoSHiT_nGsbVPTczpjsiaYxSayQ9qGRsypgrf_bqbTbHrD_nFvGOvzE_gLPSPu1C--u-DbgxVkkqyjJXb7RbPBWKMDSYymlXppQ8ysvC5K1YRqm4TvAI2JMFZfC0Nvrxc4RPtSbN-7TLN219cn3uP3kondYdLxLWsW3LquA927yo3" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Minerva, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Minerva was a temple on the short side of the Forum of Nerva in Rome. It was completed by Nerva in 97 AD - who harboured a particular devotion for goddess.<br><br> It was still well-preserved in the 16th century, when pope Paul V took materials from it for his fontana dell'Acqua Paola on the Janiculum Hill and for the Borghese chapel in Santa Maria Maggiore.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v43lccUKCu94xyTNFjU-HPbJdIEcTYNNTIPnQgVMf2AWVZv_hyHQzIQmlkStOBV_b3S6yQ5hEyEeE0-4wxkt90xT4GIQ863k075R8CR0oCxQ8ksRnvQ7VDow38S_nOuSsEClYiGXYf0RbPTYJhKxuyidN6ZYOVVDKYQZR10rIASdl3A-LtmqJ-uUwyzYQR1U97Tz7kMtqNF9o9tGZ_mKxJtnfOqYR5Vp-UleHxeHMdmE66szYKA4XHsYaJsDztwmceJMyMyhJrKMix_FrZgDvWE0-JwM-uhZeneiudb4lUfweJx3Ua84b3N3VGa6OOdyCGfkp-dqI1mXc_vMrlNySaC1dZxhOPPqCEMEgpaKEXIlED7k70W_NLIDv2P_rE-AfY2CCOLGLPS1RMlc9zdAhLPqARM0NVmYodViGTexWzygSOSAKpSRPvIOPndfCCN5nBS_g6F53V7-kq5eOdJzpAFPVHJXOBZ-v5MI_JIh34v9cFE5ZZEecY37WnvW_B865kMgAv_I1mEGb6pIl53jYq9-aWVXW3nwMEGa75o96vsTxQ1yXiaE9hULCIhiUvoWC7lHLPU70ruWHvJ9XhHk_H-ReFkJq6bRKAhyfS4bIJhNwReqpq0_72A6HR6ajd0NwQ_yH4zAyqjlvoO5L-24rsX3VtGp_SgyKyeb0OKf2rPWXfZXiVTcarrKnxIm5Y-hC4nZGLQ6JFhMQ" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
