          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Saturni (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6NJEoSwpioB0006Hq2nd1GVbROvfHbcOG_XNdFjro8btCeHR4hyJzG8vHBQKmQDJQYc6cCOODYK_F-Qo5voqtV3LFgHSkSqc9i_LtEHbR9TtIuSYtQqU1kqJY3yiFmB5bkgaszuIteaGfmmpyp76kgwRSRCBzQulLqsUgAkjCt6oxf1SUoENK2QPkIjouHz_SDMq-ycvB9IdOeZ9W-GHzDtOk_zOcWFfY6wcIofoaWWjCkBRpdpvtraFkyhj8eBsrD7XoI5f1NxVt6bcQptzYQXMHPLXU891FTnMA-5EFvDNKVnu4p8sRIp2KUWj2xCPy1yQc-QVXrnSms3SXW01uT2n2MG6jCSTPtbA30ljL7gSTCRajwbl3MQeetY8HGTj3rwJYNvfLWJg5_pbRc9ZVatxfY-qSPhTqDKVX6uaQiVPX3W4TSgkk_yR65RCYa2bgnGJOOtLhxDnyHvrUSyWQ2jcRUeEcRBzMUPvSrGZSIODapRNW2XyH7CA0LjwQuh-y23Y-xqIt-F6ZtwiFiCBf33IOhctqh_p7ooEzVFaUw8W9zYL6KI1pscI9RLJ7XYeIctIa38rB3QTmjW5ZibQPz1xgem3jb15z7rVbryLSeo0tn4imvtd9WyzqEEn7KmlGX-OnHHiKCYjM4qQjTjcemm1zwQX-Lv4wkYlRHqULksYuWo2xedcykn45HAWAuw7BolsGZLo9h7w" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Saturn, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Saturn stood in the SW corner of the Forum, between the Vicus Iugarius and the Clivus Capitolinus. <br><br>There were a number of traditions about its foundation, all of which assigned the temple to the earliest years of the Republic. The rebuilding of the temple by L. Munatius Plancus must have begun in the late 40s BC; it became one of the last great monuments paid for by an individual outside the imperial family.<br><br> There is broad consensus among scholars that the massive podium visible today is that of Plancus. The architrave records the Senate’s restoration of the temple after it had burned, probably in the 4th c. AD, and the surviving superstructure dates to this later period. Very little remains of the original staircase, which probably contained the state treasury (aerarium Saturni or aerarium populi Roman. The stair has been restored on the basis of the Severan Marble Plan.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7OUTqeQ_h_k2ZIJ1pHMDtdA-GCh91eT9qH6DSrokT9ZyEWCqy3moC7GfeKvHGukWeZ1wt0_k5PkPGuYMps87BpUTB1XvUOnZ3GNOAto5C3EzSnmV6NLvgvRHvUvpsdIVqN_ZagFsHeELt8rvVnVZWVU7QeOhbd0XfohM4h1c2WZJqGUi_6m_MMUIXt_kMY0eRxE3i5n7qwbA3UB4TBeHGyOrr8PGHzj-HlEGYRMfVLj2-WDfjG5I-OUz1QJTPJ9yrjNwj8t6wJQHauXjAjSgNq_no5n71woqkYExmAcGartTillIhZZOLn3b0ZzowhAEZBl9cKPr9f0VvBRlzTjOMgZCW4L2-xfLxNHPISW4gAZGlSbLZGEz3ldXvrPZDvkXd82x3pyCU2fCpFWcXtOxitoFKUmGw5nwgFxZxmMIzcfpEqRO327auWcx10Gxz6g0uP9PxVH7W6rRx8t_MGPMv67nmebypSP9DEACajBZlalYXJLoY73ybAxVSuGOaR-mwH_Xrsn1hU2HN9jkhmcu83lrb0jgyaBf_vcTS7ZgZiwISnhMMZ-fz5ArFo3hI7OLjuJUSQj8BXuJu3dtyl21lKBNjexbmWAbaBcHUkhdE8qQMX0vh7epaaButIWuDWhFd29rCBjc--GZf9aOVIRhZl6asztVHArE2vDqNV_KlKNrlMhkB9omuCpuY6VfVzeCxV-hkWa1cbHA" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
