      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Spei (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6SALDfUg1yfToWgE7mglPKnJKodDb38FRyb46Z7ZmOoU7VN8pmGzYvWruY9Rl0Oi31F7NNW5gNMHBZdZVYLnza7aFbbmpAAOSTvnj1-XbFILXyu73Fk5oL37qQwdlWkhtUDhvZtF5iPveF-DIntxTf0lPimPWiK5UAvlgSnnjhpCNnGJdq8FlhmuPbwJwBqgcMOk91MvvhqLkBYYQ9Qu565RZcRiCAE42hqfBA6jpcYA9asMEZ36FVyApJyKmm6011-2dLV3kFkDWyTJQW30RXUBV536rbnWFlwJrIGGWXPdEg0Ef-_fi4xHqF0Y93B6h2fHndq98Wl6ytCSC05_sVvxQCJQeiyldjoRI-7N7wPp-U-qixHpLBHZ7YlP9q1GnAlZGxOxOeVawrEa2TDuWsxsZzwMAEuiFSRNnXfD_c4r08k0sdRvegSSulJE40zo5Fe2_zmUIJk79sZnU_1SQB_2j3foC-kJo0vs-MSEQxncOjeGKABPWR_WbLBe4XA1AzLe6D2SzJt-4GoR2RNxagYTqkAZHWM7eKw0NQ-iRPZ5v7NXlOzhcR1I524O6Ti-nO2brCkjFyJkAhz-obDDE1nscdyPJB3c7c34hil_DIrajereF55Hwx9ZjsTEbRY9qxUi7sxnw0y4rlceztKc9KO6OM_gRV-R-LnL2hqAUen6CpZdmDwxlbXMTFxobOfLpVU-lZ-9VzIg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Spes, Rome.<br><br>One of the group of three temples on the W side of the Forum Holitorium, probably the one furthest S. Since the temple of Spes burned in the fire of 213 BC, it must have stood in the vicinity of the Porta Carmentalis and the “Area Sacra” of S. Omobono.<br><br> In addition, if it was the southernmost temple, it would not have been connected to the other temple buildings in 213 BC, a fact which explains why the neighboring Temple of Ianus did not catch fire.<br><br>After a fire in 31 BC, damaged the building, Augustus began its restoration, and Germanicus rededicated it in 17 AD. Though the date the restoration work began, and how much was completed by 14 AD, cannot be known, it seems unlikely that Augustus left the temple in ruins for very long. Substantial remains of the aedes, a Doric hexastyle temple, are preserved in the Church of S. Nicola in Carcere.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7UNxJ0mX289AX__AIqg9fygt5DHWjnrkaMAFFsvWDb1-I6mWTJmYHHtRiKrAs5MoIZI6gDACT7h-Z7UMZ1k_MVLa1V_Ovu-ZdBxMcBOO9WDCIky9-RqD3_Sr3hXBd0TkwL0rJiWH0uSJjzunXIsCO5K1CXDkWBTxbZkmvfNC2C28rJa2qXXfaZso_v600tJQFsqrdSZSdu