      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Traiani (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7gIm33Ttbjcyl-Ok9k0CcPqqkM_OJ2DGQgb0o405sb3dSsFXaH6hGoz95kzPebCYIyIccLkY6WkmfF9wbgFiV5pXxA14MusEKncaKI22qSCbMgJvyWZrzE6ASRRMmLq_OtuzV7g-Cdn0cBMDl2JdQ677tI3q2aaUEt1ExFOf8qC7Y_cql-s9LRsi2dzGJxIW7n27nMpZcFsbbzNBzF50FQgH8eNjdtJry0BBQ_Q-Y-_w6kRAsSuAM5dtOO-DKsEuJw3ALIAKMRWx5RZCYE-KZhlqENzE3kSoEDD3GkCYUaaegN7lvLJH0IeDU3CLllDpXP8LnQh7DmUuCyOZdeCOgc8PABdB8eURAihyU_48i4MJwgqm38vVpZmf4IdxA9XI8fV1lE6nqk-H_NigAuwLrOlWDYVNzWOWeuLX3rmgGg5XBr6iILuX4-LsJYrJsWKKhr9ycZk-HmRQK19pBIiHgs1ajl3bg7FGj8nekCxayJq-rr83yeoRrlQA87BICXtkEmIhQWp7ucIz43ryNU43rFiH8UbZIScNeqcSYhIbUiHJPkpijyQ3pe5zsNAJMacioiXmminIo_BMvdWzPqQH19Zjdy7_ChT6e64pCWtqjb1wLWBegQYXyfpb5V4YAjzdh_0ecaN_AnSXUNLsloP9TQPo0JuswTNXryIn5KWUVsAKUeTGiw42AipdlW5Lm8xrYlGWq6_8MkGA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Trajan, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Trajan was dedicated to the emperor Trajan and his wife Plotina after his deification by the Roman Senate. It was built in the Forum of Trajan, by Trajan's adoptive son and successor Hadrian, between 125 and 138 AD. The architect was Apollodorus of Damascus.]]></description>
