      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Vediovis (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6EzuD8rg5vj7ocx32HTvqEB34l7oqPfZ0Zo9CKQnl7hF07Tk7u5pbwQix_5HADHAIckF9JsfixyfrAZNxOksMdAMClt8I4gnD-uWQySZ_70S6jz15pZQ3-vT9SGC7FnDI74TiOeG8umCDBsRnWBT6OmWaaourZZ3Hc1O9TUMQt6U0YRiZ-Tx_fHutnAnZXmBRavtDkY0O4_a7SGpBuh_ZDKWTN0rW-L7ICbPR_WOUGJXOVCW33su5Weg6D6NxEGsCk_OOLzDmdn_i5TTlsJPUk8xGKFFHFmRV_EC-0VW17a1UIOLcYDnvsC0OTd2cejz-4CClwGUugbht-afqNTct3cccqcM1WaemxLo5EBho9g_EhqvLxWwtU0Lb048WvcmJW-Q75gPn-ThwBqfiZHxXE3KNNSEH44dRGH8lrLoQRw5mSJWkxB1cCEalw9uYeIwANzI3I9AEMWmPsTu5tmGBr7KeV23uy4SunNzgmeC-xIUg5foWI0WoA_Rt7NkQx8sPfR0V4emydaXsztxX83vGbF7I2F7xOhfAhrVPIwx4Zbuc1Ddpue-vYjaKPsea0jI6Iy1oXNCZtbrmL1VtPDcxUT-Jgauuxv3_cVs8yx6sMc3yQTOlpxA-5Wx_BrntKnvmn3PuBRB2UV7cMumkcLTURV_aDuRDAF6yrNnJrKhLwq6X1ki7HRMgNsU4WA9sTeo5IlI1AzbpXuw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Vediovis, Rome.<br><br>A temple dedicated to Vediovis on the Tiber island, known only from literary sources and epigraphic evidence.<br><br> The shrine was vowed by the praetor L. Furius Purpurio in 200 BC and dedicated by C. Servilius in 194 BC.]]></description>
