      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Veiovis (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6gG8pmNTwcpUcUqYAGGmooft_yG-dAguSVkh2oJNxe_bcHgOD5v8qsr4D-78nGfEqCmo_43kJItSqlEp1hfo8VtPG6DIU6bRTT9d3m1WndebmAt-AzX5hinmeux-FVTeMkWkmSAmX2A6XP-SU7GXb9zFzhZA0ReM0DCryxAaT2vCz9SH7X65_W7qy9xeZAArICSvTgU-LXEiybEzZvFRVlRaUA2fmtarPplD5jxNX-20552zqe2bE88v9GmF9mo-_whKUJ1IPHHD1j6re-aITwnTucIp8YLIhEAAU0xhepLdnn5OjUaDgSry6ZEVERQXh7Z-tlpCzIn5UT9AOTcUL01HAEKjBOaO9mPWRaQnvb8hJ_Tb85p07Aw4NGRrkAEFEVq4AcuPtGxBiRd0cTw9N0Q9Lr_pQ4hN3h_AaYpTTJXsIKVLyTujSweKCdKAo3nIl-czUSiRRbR6u5VAwE9FvbCrKzXZpV8I4J5v1YW_xEMj_To8FZc4lUq9K_cPVh6RsIXrzqCypSqt1kEcCw2LG0JG4DQok8T9sDJCIIXeL2pfjmaCKU2K-RBIRd4FjWvTbAskO_lLyGrcwkVsEbZREhdodByLm2jq7Mr09_U_I8GWdNGBvGP-H1ObqdusmyvED7eOp7lE_8o7mV088LKJ8O-bV2Mq-FKfgLr6Td3M5VP4c9qaKX9TVD0P0Z17rcocXgoXqgCnW6jg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Veiovis, Rome.<br><br>The temple dedicated to the ‘young’ or ‘bad’ Jupiter in 192 BC and rebuilt in the early 1st c. BC was located inter duos lucos, in the same area as the Asylum. <br><br>It has been identified with the remains of a small temple under the SW corner of Palazzo Senatorio on the Capitol, nestled into a corner of the later Tabularium. Its ground-plan, unusual on account of its transverse cella fronted by a tetrastyle pronaos, is well established through excavations.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6Gc4XtE18VRmvYAdOt5sI_nATremfdOpe23I25YZ6lfQdQGPm6fYPwsEFIrdOEtKF4D_s6S5GTKcWvMEMA1TiFOcEJyD3AF1sHODWcYOtbN52KX0Bn5G_WpnO4cY6kJH58WUOogC3lhrygtb2VJgGtRLHgTmXqu1nRSLI-NJ8-mqj-Lk62L817sub8T4JEHYNcXJK3Igfg-YoQbD2Hax008okbFQN5O0UFD6s1GjuaSntn46Bs5t-eybysZEGrayoNy1TWb-r1prSLC7nn1HgTztJlj5jFhT0hO1uADSPYe_arukCoMBbCpW_sJ9pxNkiJJEg66fldaEVfVi0BYnJn8zxkzMyabXNR-uW-P5hADoq0V21mkY-SzWwAzGIwCE8EoJ5Q4JU-R_3qYRjx2e-u9r-UYnklSrrr3Aeut5vgliBg-ecB1dJW-OknrOz3qMgfMxCJhm1v0PPCxHaKuverc0tK3MUoQUXUsa-HhLR33XZvSpvSSPsR6lpS9D1Wr_JS6-L2ktEljmHxfWYcnDcdcMEe76YPPuzt0aHlKAgxLDOjSFb-QYxXpy0O2WY4WCrTmEKuT0oX5anCZWb3-TPpeKKHx