      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Veneris Erycinae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4Hpt14qfU4mgkEO00Q9hpqV5JvWeXe4yYmH3c-lxrqfU0JfHPs69VQnnu2pUlKlFEZ2Ek6Da9lJorPYy-SOj4drVBBRTWEa6KIAbeRvT2uLRFwa6Yq620aVL6s0WNIkNjayz0rrRZOnvSfOexbZLzHDVd-9kCW0FOKT-8mD7WsJVbAP6VXObR6GuV43DXmznNlMVBwbS1L0WkeB7W3KS14WI0HBigvYnoJgFtKWbIp9Phvo24p8mmE0NhfI0aAnf027GWoYNVB9XdbJjR5myJ7prpAifv-oN1k3ZhOWmSa_P0r2d9-Ws3ZdEWX9K6DJ-Ll_c8QzOr_hVUKuX0W2DmMCvWJNf7BTyle2w-nodi7n4YjtHsJEXWZ1RdoYqtKChfXABN_-t_jACaD3WT7aupGztOtAoBtyoa1xyoYa8GvUFaH-TX5OYjuQ3BU2jd2gmqlU0vaEh8-EbWAT1WMN_lGmEVPlhyQYeF8uS6SJRc6YOMGXoZ8w5IH3uLEUDMNEZkCCVRPtERL670q6OXB4GnZWcLLhMyAg1TQ-qIN8k5hV2WHXuuGjm-FZAD77OsejdYSPg1KFfljMxVA6T0yrzl2wSsNo5OjOoawM7kZYfcZjJAhH5HQuIHDVXLIqurOGGq-fKjCFOOFXSs8OaFC22YSpTZ5DKMKFetEOp6yOTsALNCokgCg9q-4mdBmSvYKnxsKyqVcLAQqww" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Venus Erycina, Rome.<br><br>Twin temples are known only from a Severan Marble Plan fragment of the S slopes of the Area Capitolina.<br><br>Nothing remains in the archaeological record since this part of the hill has been lost through landslides. The names of these temples, one a narrow apsidal temple and the other a larger hexastyle podium temple, are not shown on the Marble Plan. Sometimes they appear on modern maps but are not identified. However, the fact that the temples are adjacent provides a clue as to their identity, for several Capitoline temples were regarded as pairs. <br><br>Two strong candidates for the Marble Plan Temples remain: Mens and Venus Erycina. These temples stood in Capitolio, probably in the Area Capitolina. They were vowed in 217 and dedicated in 215 BC. Most importantly, they stood next to each other, separated only by a small drain. Livy’s description fits the Marble Plan Temples especially well.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5jMN07Xi9Ye4z5STf97y1MDSqHucwQfeQxoNZxrwQYsxixBmK0ODQwnfEUShBuznpIyt7SaH68Z0w1nXYgbeGrPZRY03WjgHhfD1KaAnGM6Aqb_8a0cGzUI5HC-tM1Kf5Gz03kkJTdFt7sOTIG4yA9SH0ORC6jBUP3ucYGdrcMH_JzXn0b1aknXAvf91DeYuH2A_NhWjtFUEa2DqzZ23Tu19e1fA_KF6aMfoTAY9leVObWqpUY0xbRE5SaKYXYtrqVMC4_AZJ5PQ2ewPso_unro_90bHYblImYcGC0bomHYqmMSUZA7ID0m-GZE6vrQ4xfCdDmeqz90Baihl2XF3SMZVBaUdoQ_jiKaIKKy8LFUZWug1r3SMrqkHTyKnM2_uB-bUJeQxMjQ1s11lOfube7q8Y0hyLZx009CajnIJlofm-gmD8yH1hFCkPmwIAVt2ghY6_hJuoZYXq3vJZi_8-JfnZxKKKZzNYUNiKLWKdKoXjpJ_CmoJjlTOYNIl_LP-horMSQmwdiRbWCwSawlaW51nGEw9wpPlBre4m2LBqe-qUbCpPhMFBVY9j85LPe09utGIgZy6hlrx28wKE-ZM4x5SDeu0DZyrfoFA7mFmNlaUc6LklR0aiUzaO8zirAzBO6fYxqA2S1_cqsoJ9mXeoaTTUjBEUkYzx7xMsV2Ik9tchNgs_8Em5_ZyRYnsnGL-XpW6ZtuWLpLw" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
