      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Veneris Genetricis (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5kZA8dy44cbDZtF4IBj9ew1N3FtfvdSDHJCeQftYLbrS6-rNEU-A8L3b8gmh__HYNezyWXWwbbe2lF3kzdY4Niei0x_lTssFfDN-r4AJAsaygQkb-rwnGzJVm8yRxXBQPNb014xoy4vpWhmNfkTWYxJhSZF8Pr47faX7mTp07ZWSnivJ8Pyc2xq1weypV4bWuXFn8m_L0Yw1M6j1V_bbXDzrAN3RvLajec3gA855kz29nGrUItA04rLVEPZ1JAxvojkz1zJOzZ5pVKs8FstUrJI_4FjHaRX-OwUOIstpIxdkHAtTkrssqliX7HuXhlp8-ixWkVso08UABcFBRdIwGI89G2JPHkinyomKPQYxcUKttzq-ttv8aKAHLvF09YlTYGbKHVZ9rgU9BfRB98p0S8V_V-Qee258m_h-O0QpMZjByB7MHK052X23Fw5Z8R3lcUoWOvtZGK3dBuj9e5JdpJ8Lmnewi30d6-A5nqRDLcmqdRkui_L8ZQ2i71sfj5hV0Nzp1NRL7opOebnSCEzLqjX77PnxvAPffAvkOOlZJODES_sRiyZ9iVl9hltJM0fWqILGmXOxCl6c-cw6jQWCJXcpyODfTqT2bzBOdTluVXGOKyAmeLNBVwQoxoqPNHfJg_xFPdLMG9o5Zli5gREkj84_iljSQRg0SwQhB9ADI9pchZn4lqh-oiOSUGdXoN9wC4PdYqpNxVTw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Venus Genetrix, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Venus Genetrix in the Forum of Caesar, was dedicated to Venus Genetrix, the goddess of motherhood and domesticity. It was dedicated in 46 BC by Julius Caesar.<br><br>On the eve of the Battle of Pharsalus, Caesar vowed the temple to Venus Victrix. He eventually decided to dedicate the temple to Venus Genetrix, the mother of Aeneas, and the mythical ancestress of the Julian family.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v79WcDh_cCcocijTQQmjl7wP8_vd68H3Dh2LAFsSWpWwFa5kXM0IyY_2RjF5jLI0fHyCR_leQ-jWZBl6L1jd8ZhfbjYOtWJ373u3gtRtCunsajWBALINmL4rWMlM9XVmd2N8RVHdUZb1b141cvfxM6Lmxxy2uSkVVQO7qDPMKfDteUMV4q0z8pxrHffQ9YmIeb64q0ozv_nHVoimcGSwZcqZRJQvzADhRBvQI025hK3ATv8NTGhMuo2m5asudQfLlrfWwyrb6uA8e-BDAzgVXvFH1AkcP2tnBhA8WXPJbsqYa01FERO-elP7H3zcUI5d6A_unXaGZuOym6H-eUlilkbqZxF_ODTySOGnwmSOs_fk_mM6o1Eb4AHg29Phmv-FgtxhhAf0OHpxsxHVYtLzR-_5RJwFqJiR3HdlaVwfWxoxV6n3oTqRgLLD9klquv-0vUZ0i6_V48yRSqD5UE6-sA0H6krKcFRXoJ2_vw80R__KvTUN7eNu-t6jAKV6BbMPye3Jsdh3USFyHjDScMyjWaIZVMZhegLRwSfkn9yil1QSlUwvvUZtDs0SzUFtxp0XcUIDMcYfJAgWtK9d4PF3IDDPr_7UAAabohzLxBnpC76dEjDJRKwt9OUAwqWRlyBX9SWOdfSyL8Yz8HnN0M5tVj0p