      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Veneris Victricis (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7taA8oG9ravs5tSmTZJ4DP7jL6aT4t53o40tK5A5ge5MhyRC1Qd7DsbWf5k7p1ISN7p3hs7U-RAFzWH6BkgJIGS7kBEBLcq_jTD57flSxZU8bIx_EamzQpobsbdJw-Xx_VGP6SG9lsXlkLZqFOjURKhD7zw_QVUr7eh7PvJlrO3ZEy-iN1qc986IAt7rkzAmmKbU38Vj1oQ7iQb5Iy0V06pQAn8xXYTH5qb3jepIgtQ0Q0ulHS2H8DMZALAKsXtPVRq8ldPpdA7WoEz6KjY7i4LdjqFmt9IQfj0nbilx-Sn9KRlyZne7jQD32Fc8cGVmiiySoD3ba6h7Sx-w89iJA-ez-ucMVM0Upv4QDPaiV_VBYcXKeJEZXojQW6rn33QAoziFX5jeSDn45BbG0LuSuStJHP5j0m1NayLuhxGZ8HXpIoxiMLH-turmwsCAVuCkOrtl2I2rEtEE2QU81DiF03tYg-7pDaYmFyiYEL8Tm2AhyWmXV7Zyk59_bDY1WbX73ewXJwoG4AMyM2wAvqIgBMloEiEyA0u8HRoqyh67CpSgnGYXwIgTk3YzurJn5lK5LdZXXMZhSd00PJONEreOeKnwfO9Rc5stZvW1OvBcGA0ZYu1hCPkXK6cRP0oNr1R4GPdU2emMfQn8rfvRxfE7wgw_j9igCQydVgKlt0libCIKCYpArL3fsK6yUEVGyf1X584CM2kuh5xg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Venus Victrix, Rome.<br><br>Pompey had a temple to Venus Victrix built near the top of his theatre's seating; Pompey then claimed that he had "not [built] a theatre, but rather a temple of Venus to which I have added the steps of a theatre".<br><br>It was dedicated in 55 BC.]]></description>
