      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Veneris et Romae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7rXsQCmRV27IY22D9X3LNfipd7IVboRkjTQgIx_UMzCAf8VULh1MueT4owyVbQiDXjLmPKQ-CUI-gOiH7vxBIfv6XvwUSbiRU-rm6WNF_EOIEx5ZR1I2cLzfaYiM0Co10nqBf53cZhkkj4n9CJXt2DDy0qvFckRZjTNJU5zJh3uUGVX1H1Xeo4OyRcrkiFhbLl44ji4nXH99VZa5T-xHNIUZoljeAJIRQWa4BcLQbITnExhbK97OgvbDPuSMUArrgHkGatKJ6Rh1BejojXI7KUS5VOlcCTY1ibkNdsnuKl1EKb082SeeA_IdZ7BqIcFUofXfX2sJidBnYH_Vqr0PaFvct3XlDUNHrPKR_Nixttl-kQZshg4goQ8XUmeOYN36xLxbK7y2F85e0nS4kLgmyLGSzPpIj0tSY4HUlto-IT-fzsZOj28kLBjiap_PmbAWSfo-dDTzheqtIrJxSdjaIgFBm74uyrRTLAND1yJ91zsnWUktRtszYd3aDNrXQWTJyst125assqvPj8RwkT9uiGG3hHPDlU-cRA_yVjbhsYfFBY1vinfNCV3vC4UJdhkt-hRazvvIDfSH0xr6Gwi5y-TGCQ95lnS2OtW357iQdJl_sGJTbdX-gnqlvDPyauNOuegNqp66pG38ib1r8haSUbGfFxwhJvDrHJU4nHyUsgdbVMTkPHouF1nEBgxMcj3Bb9Vu3Bb7zKQQ" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Venus and Roma, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Venus and Roma is thought to have been the largest temple in Ancient Rome.<br><br> Located on the Velian Hill, between the eastern edge of the Forum Romanum and the Colosseum, it was dedicated to the goddesses Venus Felix ("Venus the Bringer of Good Fortune") and Roma Aeterna ("Eternal Rome"). The architect was the emperor Hadrian and construction began in 121 AD. It was officially inaugurated by Hadrian in 135 AD, and finished in 141 AD under Antoninus Pius. Damaged by fire in 307 AD, it was restored with alterations by the emperor Maxentius.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4U-WgEZqyRRukJ5LAJ1l5y3I4b7LFKzf1mDepPlDdimsUi89u42TEqhVlXbQl-6EWbyTewFRi-dhLDanRqyrML3gWX8OajNO8pn-S1XDzwV_aYd6kfiCGQ-ETyG5y0Wwl5ACzvXX0d3z7-DkRkYLZQCnNQR9UVnFkGCbAAl76nLMFrzbw-ynNB7FSuUCCTK_syCuVijFcxo53iLnnHsRIOlxz7igANnkjTG71t_Ph2rG8btwjB90ZwKE5mGJbnm9GpLZetcBg0dHa99l6KVcaqfqtfVKq4UFYk2773ndv26LzGVUyeLvOmxAl3XF2A2Gjf5GJK9d7-doP10yc1V92u3SVkD_I6yEsiAB1pD1yi6vpZ_2El3rNRQd1gX7Pp9pTX13t7Vwh9GZJMdE4xJtxVjmnoTT6qgVTYqz8XWG8SVJ7Kwt-q259pndcQoF29X1m2wn2kmBUgDAsU_zKF5Ksx4zG_mGNAz4jNUaAT1vI3P-lP_m