      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Vespasiani et Titi (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4g7vN1EODADZkG9Q2MRqcGVq0rVIkSJ54HGoqT9IXLn-UEq1ewYBxdR9kgLOaUMHZ6pZUJp8PnXsryOEgYpYYSaUy3-YM88awEM6VbFfYNUPXl7ZOLOlSU6uOmoOMUB3CtP1DMLAPyUeLQdIcj3gAKQtPcJOKecBxy5IedAmflmTHiWgEevE2xlFtzL1eWTONivJ8GoWmcFCcMICk0MJe0JnmbWNHySKz93l2ILcSnNHZYNCn-Qru_k_XyTpR4JW5FOCUHYSn97D296bEMh1DDmAh_4hSkJzdk0CMtQUceGSQvAF6dH_Ro6pm5-ZIAkoasV9diGDu82sqjcw8r5B0di5UAbzQEvQ54WJphSQ3qp2wNmssaOwJQN1jdtwGwLhq5ZhsI_BUiVxMD6xRbqWgFEthgMD7hklpC5saL9vIVUB3or8MEALlNPp_HmDnNGqfsAU41ufoAMtp3LQBK8g3UISZa52IoFefcQe1gznG_Ae_YYP8fFX5VaeuEWGdH4qkgapwgKoUuXBzh8MpTXPqgr-3ZQfoDOX0X94eADI57IUPI1-u1SKmDR8AO093ohgBd45mH4uDZjeF5vVjFkLHTtvMAHV9KXQ6380lXgBOOqSKGNauHX01f3fzLOKy5AMghan3qW8we1asvbsKQv2gZLh3XtnVi8lJ0oRIAUAtdRQlkqU__jr_k1HA7weCx173OMJSFfX4GUw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Vespasian & Titus, Rome.<br><br>The Temple of Vespasian and Titus was located at the western end of the Roman Forum between the Temple of Concordia and the Temple of Saturn. <br><br>It is dedicated to the deified emperor Vespasian and his son, the deified Titus. It was begun by Titus in 79 AD after Vespasian's death and Titus's succession. Titus’ brother, Domitian, completed and dedicated the temple to Titus and Vespasian in approximately 87 AD.<br><br>It was in the Corinthian order, hexastyle, and prostyle. It was particularly narrow due to the limited space, measuring 33 meters long and 22 wide.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6VOBjfi211FusFZDIuDLcAK-GEuf3ikKflypqUf8Kvo0O8ZPyQOIhfE7qcmlpv7iEO_qtSioVp-v9LLHeJhihYW0BurDKacbQuKtGN_NOjzWr-jxd-ewTtEM2czPYOqYMBILFDToWiuTV5R2DQx3EF-KOClymPJuELwNkm4INByrwmB0tg3PIWMpZ7MZPPJgTlixm_tPn_8RyYoYXbTDXsGDxx3KMz2rb-BpIMTqac6_q9U4tKZi_Ac-kmcy3D1fmlxLt2y8JnwYYPUhXQ4LOJRQqX-mqtvDcVhnko-5VCj_fU4hhQ8SEnHwxJqfvErg5JamZ6Y7EgTbsTwyHbSS22BoXYlJX2G6v86J0NshnEHKGRP1VnMVWw7-jUDUy3v1lLHdZtdqW25xjvho59Kz8TXUviozdLAas7Xiv96Phq-jd6JHDd4XF-4PnoC7q6dptHO0Q31OoZ405NL9dZVSH4Hitx-1LSUYakXa