      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Vestae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7_pha0PYZTsC4nrTbjvVdE-WAULJdx3-8uFj1x_RMsiyjIplSETRNV7VatpbzUf-ic4EJv29-YhTvqCT11rGRnX5XTmvvAecQrkpQoDbYHWiuBJlg4nvBk4S8W3xZ_eZGbF-Tsb3ilM-6KSrJzY_pWIQbTwc-wj_YGSp5_l7Kdtrk8bsMgckV6ZdzmAjJH6mD9VkGsR39Mtrj_uZIft0faq4nfDSTQsTmvoz-NSY-KEqZBhWys63r4u5Z8RvvRXg6fLJENpMi0PXXD1U4oCdRcuASoOyznJ_r1-suOupjCiPphLnXj3N13kaCXC4PRYcZ11FgPGyyV2UhssLdWqN-fAag8yeE96cOJZ9pkJfQBXpHvHEOS6VrI3j3G-vdYuMmcIPvml0m_mhMoW802xUW6MG4f-m6xis_gPRVtPaWoaJkByqikRAntnvUg9yje-RdcAQ4wXLvGLDN3TKrXSF7Iae3Vc065RCqDRbBtr07oZEKXvSYWb4IgXfbMCBRhn7ajrWIkh81qPsFYJLIlIwXz_sGOADtb2A8c945fRk85PF-FPQfjmMR-MYpC6aUNRxkKa0V1wOC_x0XdMEqJFyfOgIlz87EXGKUOSOjKszvrDj6Wn7-6YLTWsbqLSrxSOIvhWrMPiUzFNq3WpClKqW7Iki3dpC0meaUWGe9melWCgSAr-8v4DfnJLHmtYfAJgzrubXbT5wgIcA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Vesta, Rome.<br><br>The circular temple of Vesta, located between the “Arcus Augusti” and the Atrium Vestae, which Roman tradition assigned either to Romulus or to Numa.<br><br> The temple burned down frequently, at least once during the Augustan period. During the Imperial period the temple was a typical domed tholos. Most scholars agree that, while the existing superstructure is Severan, the podium is Augustan.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7unqByMU_D3r4fYFgL2KGzezgL5bjlt-3GENTNrWtmuN5BLig_NzBQiuqnsKPwq2M0MfUaBIQX8kiYQQSjSW6ISDaoD53EeqDdMszC_vD6CnULWuBC_soan1De768o6debYFBNYrB1QPW1enTbgq3-qpG9LMwGG35TozibRFA68Igiw0HrrognAg5MPYpC5JQl4LpxiY9aT94UOUrKAqczEz7-BVL39bdav0UVFN7m3QvoTnvTBiFhhTCgPFY2vnZ1_j0D8z1UyI8MRpbWsrl2M3cZKNLMHfTnQNzfM-azNvx8ken23NwF1vxezdBVdGF4D9ob5QZrn2X899opsxBxFQKowXz6nAlSEO4juFlw0OeS2ExQrZ-z3znVd6_SracrG_49xKHw0hlo9DuKPtR8V10cXenJmUtCYkV0UsKx4Lt3WAehGPgHOnwMVPfRT6e_Xj_C-x2G9WnW7N1FSjPB8R-QIhtUOeP1e-rDNe3nQds6kVLwQux4NzgmtKIi--V0Eim4Kv9tPCetMjsRDgmXpaE_sEoMDh0K-t_HTXcvoEQRF0WwcjLO4kJISwmWJcvOo_Ub4xjgljWVgUoLJFMVXolOidFqWwSzKAPIv3It_d3wzJOFZg_K3Jq_ykFt68Uwfw4HTgEyr8QHLxsTnEbJE-Y0yF-3Odmv2_9AkPgTNnWqw5G8j0pH--vl8hfDXrs0TFtAUI8-LA" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
