      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Templum Victoriae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6AdaQdphFZ3c8NTh0jjtAEvicKd0ub4Q9IjH8BrefVWwpSUpHAFSJjK4jwNcbRtqQHghfNh9Z75-cE-JB8ZekwKMu6P9_LcjDEs3704VyvTmovmj17b0hkFnYsEqXI-Ou7WxDQsgqTY2OaeRJYcZZYCxsc1go61p62MIVkt4-Qy4mt69rrnI2CHOJIuxwUWPlV8iIZbO-2QzEpen82kCUUmrd7-71i1GYVXJwohvSW3Asykpb1gLX7fg03plQ_hGQb-3S3D7DhBw1Y3k-HJiyiKI5rRd1DN6epYB-Kwqeb1Lj6U3lC9pWG9m4kuj6SuJwyi79eYbszZY7A3vLHgxkN2knNa85sZ-DTcurlQABXSVASXpyQJN2oli38G30AijVLj2MWTbJj-HlMyuHu6W8fdxio5CXccdJtLw-zJunGp28O7d2bn8gfuormDEea3jJ2w6KKtRls_0gihV277EoEFrLa6XeCj33wRHrRh8DyMFY2EYuKaKYxZG1DTziG1MmL2JgIO43V821pQEvzw93sPhvPXT7cgqessIaTg0X0lPgePXyuN5UTRavkUJBp0GuJP27lRao3-wH14AnS94mAGBeoIFHsd9kH4MQbDX8h4gqR5dOPOsJDXq8JiYUhHR2xJpLgc6cmRetF5k1D-7j_tGZ4xT8i8T75sGc4QgzS4d8LEJh8jGXBCqUEpg4A26_VbtBL8IF5oA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Temple of Victoria, Rome.<br><br>Temple to Victory on the SW Palatine adjacent to the Temple of Magna Mater and the shrine to Victoria Virgo.<br><br> Dedicated in 294 BC by L. Postumius Megillus, the temple was substantially restored in the late-Republican or early-Augustan era, perhaps in the wake of the fire of 3 AD. <br><br>Substantial architectural remains, identified as the Temple of Victoria due to their location, size, and close relation to epigraphic material pertaining to Victoria, include fragments of Corinthian capitals and other elements in travertine, which suggest a restoration during the third quarter of the 1st c. BC. The temple’s opus quadratum podium (c. 33 x 19 m) originally supported a hexastyle, peripteral sine postico temple with a double row of columns along the façade. The restoration retained the same plan, while augmenting the cella foundations to support an internal colonnade, and replacing the tufa superstructure with a Corinthian columnar order.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1548-795548</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value>https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6AdaQdphFZ3c8NTh0jjtAEvicKd0ub4Q9IjH8BrefVWwpSUpHAFSJjK4jwNcbRtqQHghfNh9Z75-cE-JB8ZekwKMu6P9_LcjDEs3704VyvTmovmj17b0hkFnYsEqXI-Ou7WxDQsgqTY2OaeRJYcZZYCxsc1go61p62MIVkt4-Qy4mt69rrnI2CHOJIuxwUWPlV8iIZbO-2QzEpen82kCUUmrd7-71i1GYVXJwohvSW3Asykpb1gLX7fg03plQ_hGQb-3S3D7DhBw1Y3k-HJiyiKI5rRd1DN6epYB-Kwqeb1Lj6U3lC9pWG9m4kuj6SuJwyi79eYbszZY7A3vLHgxkN2knNa85sZ-DTcurlQABXSVASXpyQJN2oli38G30AijVLj2MWTbJj-HlMyuHu6W8fdxio5CXccdJtLw-zJunGp28O7d2bn8gfuormDEea3jJ2w6KKtRls_0gihV277EoEFrLa6XeCj33wRHrRh8DyMFY2EYuKaKYxZG1DTziG1MmL2JgIO43V821pQEvzw93sPhvPXT7cgqessIaTg0X0lPgePXyuN5UTRavkUJBp0GuJP27lRao3-wH14AnS94mAGBeoIFHsd9kH4MQbDX8h4gqR5dOPOsJDXq8JiYUhHR2xJpLgc6cmRetF5k1D-7j_tGZ4xT8i8T75sGc4QgzS4d8LEJh8jGXBCqUEpg4A26_VbtBL8IF5oA</value>
