      <Placemark>
        <name>Domus T. Pomponii Attici (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Residence, Rome.<br><br>Republican-era residence of T. Pomponius Atticus, located somewhere near the Temple of Quirinus  and not far from the Temple of Salus.<br><br> No archaeological remains of the domus survive but it was said to have been a tasteful rather than a costly home, with charming gardens.]]></description>
