      <Placemark>
        <name>Domus Tiberiana (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6Tbb9sQjdRDOpnRvKdwThv7W00S_mawJlnE3MZEyLRpgD0-TmYvwN89MYJagzdwG3orN6ZZ7CmBs1Mh8F0-M2UWHsHfIVPh_2WZeNYvhlhkZJakholpOY07DGgtwK1bqY7ddCOhilEER9-ilriNjp1vcY51rBaPiJ4Ne1KOykbXfl-XafVa76WstvBs_KW2rxAK_j_24x3JVQCKrRXsq7ht1qbwqdad3soZR2J7skVi5-ODJomJDo9VJMFWZsVCVps4e3FNPPzRTdORJ4O2CawQZ9k39kTvxYRlMNVDLYurQpK3xA8-83Cj-UvxLrtUh0USQi5Jug1RK3_Xtws0Ic7oaL19dmCVJBpEIBCsPd_jf7aNfZnvlu3Xfj2HQCDbJhqLebMDLE0Q7p7tP-wWsbMJu6bhcPM2g-G46i7hI_Eb8PlvB-M_MT08crpQLeSGbfGZ8BuizCJYF8G-r1VH_Lgg9YqT1u5FGjkgrfBtKQqbrWRim8b8fnRazL8FRcxVmPOr0mZb195lcKCPsDzKj3dk2hPCM839dNGoDAyDm9S4f2lrExSRzH1qPiDqBK-bFOJEhUhgMYpRgmDQz9v09ebcBNHUvMkNDPjQKfrjD0ma5lCgYAAysKuH_wkzhqbNGisTH8m1m8-vTwo4YXPDgyYk4BztsP0Yvs7zhb_P-RgqbpNp0FPxpypj8MhO79FHoyZ0LFnFknyZw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Imperial Palace, Rome.<br><br>Despite its name, this palace on the northwest sector of the Palatine was not erected by Tiberius but by his successors, Caligula and Nero. Very little is known about its design and phases because it is still buried beneath the Farnese Gardens, laid out in the 16th century by Cardinal Alessandro Farnese. The mad emperor Caligula, linked the palace to the Temple of Castor and Pollux by a bridge. The emperor would appear there and receive divine honors along with the cult statues of the Dioscuri. After Caligula's assassination, Claudius removed the bridge.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4m5JLvPAqC1onL_v2h4qZrCgFNdrVnOX1xS4BIkIEpQ8yCjt6D1PXuQOAtljLsZd1s32nY9cdv1y3prFTzfZvEX_ogOR3cK_3aCbCPN7xCeB8LpW5lGFoBrrXbQ2ubPuDRKnbe-07kbgJ47vtzWzuY2pcoIg9ZD0VDxR3KuR3E03ADie_Fpxktm-XqCCDKEfw_WoVSU8cfcpREN281epLjcrpTKAcHqvaRh9MoZGi0vfGVXgEaHkKXp5ONMkH6sD95niFG8uaYWOoAMZTTWAMMydxqHMMx9VRGp3Do0p-GhZEz42JveDxcOSoM0rLEOh1BfHhZCXWJqk-7q37pZOGada3oqxwGJc2kmVV3c5r5-SXcqejuLBcFch14InJtDX6i6A40r8glqarcqpsHTq8pF92oFY6OPdLZYHaRnjp69Bh0_XZFUCrLtjYN9tQCsiR4ea4W_j6pH1hAZR9Yox-roEN7ZeX-xMhb02lfFvpEB5xLTRCTLWeMdaw95r