      <Placemark>
        <name>Villa Quintiliorum (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzK5d7xs-OXKHtqIhSRUJFaMUxIUApPLoRSa8774-8BJdXkcXKgHAFa5wmSg5mwx5u6U5O86Y6IIbwqGRCRyVQ8UPtOzllzAjExxRFrQPs4Aa-XF1NzXRHJNmD4uZ2jyKFoKHbTNGCVSNEjE94KBfgEJljjcsGrWRpXmiX_dZ_0HF-o4DJEqbZZDOBdsFTBxRpw35Vzdf8uwA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Country house, Rome.<br><br>The Villa of the Quintilii is a villa beyond the fifth milestone along the Via Appia just outside the traditional boundaries of Rome. It was built by the rich and cultured brothers Sextus Quintilius Valerius Maximus and Sextus Quintilius Condianus (cos. in 151 AD).<br><br>The ruins of this villa suburbana are of such an extent that when they were first excavated, the site was called Roma Vecchia ("Old Rome") by the locals, as they occupied too great a ground, it seemed, to have been anything less than a town. The nucleus of the villa was constructed in the time of Hadrian. The villa included extensive thermae fed by its own aqueduct, and, what was even more unusual, a hippodrome, which dates to the fourth century, when the villa was Imperial property: the emperor Commodus coveted the villa strongly enough to put to death its owners in 182 AD and confiscate it for himself.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwyCCgt4gqoY_B5xy67rAeqP18kVEqKusM1v8B2CW17zTXOMqMhtXkBeI1rWsK2AJhPM1QMVQYvKtRYQBpgBytEaN-SDMUfCDBX3OjS35qhXEdKobDj0XZ5yUDfA2drQab7LIb7aaM6FOteb5byMnbCNbsVRiOUgTr8f3B2syLUoJspj7eww6HeGCP5owQG2A3gkcpaRzhW3Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gy83vX8kxCjp8qURlJnxbIefTUN90SaBw8w3nxnuo-9d26kZkGRZk_0RnC5kooR9TjA3dzhM7ewv9K__iWatFz4Dft4oybHoeLWcidEBqgyO3-t65XbxskmcZdcLm_IAIJ5ex7AQN9zXcRE5jb9dRXrpSJBrdFoUJoGUO9gJ3fbrTLNRefVUa8xD3G8EgO7NSSHwhbwI9QfPg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gwh40JoF-YeafJ4e5RKSGlhHxzEXkn1vCumkcWwWc33anLpCM6FgUXbJC4TUmf4ZMrE67LDVGfE0ezshPUKGg0n4F80UIj2kVyb9wm_3FM-97eDHOfPRDwnS6UZ2U33Yl6Vtv3hKTDp8N0dKZ92m9czYBBtZXJjo7j5ASQ1D4zYW-rfEGIUMSkkwfKFJ_5_Cn3IYvvZxfZ0u9o?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
