      <Placemark>
        <name>Forum Boarium (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7iRh-2wKddAZQ5WlOzJ5ll_J_LCZtRulQIk6npcRyVRn5dQPv45zuQifGAV5b9O9CATjoXvQi8VlN0kncJCkcj2UugFzVkV5pE-hh_ckVRM-jadffAAM_5aStH7YslhYqs459aQ2Gpf16F028BhGMAHd9OP0LPf1JxQ3XyR75rVWveSnhDF5IMWJOei3wMY9yna9CW21_cN9I_gOaDc8gV7qbqauAvGBt0UD9rqZSw8NMwTMLo7-W_fKCt_38k7WHKezmLV3sUgkeFpdAyCGkJ48oBgJC6vH4z2W-Wvgp0KHu5929EnTIt5wFhd3cOzbxRXtleTtb4lhi6SzLQN93Rwf36vDw2Hff-t0z35TcBzBBJcnNCdYTVbKTtL204pbrxLTwpOFJKftACCXRRy3smEaKrG3vs5FjXBtPeD9PWgwEAVWeP03Zal8MwBBsWv_Qv3UChbQIZ1IabDSPSBCK5NH77RPpIsRDrLmVZ5oG6MQNwNeUQAeVvQTgAYnvi-rU_v0sjGU_odJaRssJDhXvDgqgHsrqcZheALHPDiphXgWpw31OlPhAhqVKJFryAAUQ2ahLImQ8ZMyJ-ASdqeP1ZqByE1auV8l9TxqoGHYap3SRhgoCOIrR5nGiVavhccn-Xv_jgk0X9CgClyQZPxSUpLp5NDLzdQW3cr_WjlKgzidvXUiBQ-7S79hXATzJgTP8AGs2zHbE4" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Cattle market, Rome.<br><br>The Forum Boarium was the cattle forum. It was located on a level piece of land near the Tiber between the Capitoline, the Palatine and Aventine hills. As the site of the original docks of Rome (Portus Tiberinus), the Forum Boarium experienced intense commercial activity.<br><br>The Forum Boarium was the site of the first gladiatorial contest at Rome which took place in 264 BC as part of aristocratic funerary ritual—a munus or funeral gift for the dead. Marcus and Decimus Junius Brutus Scaeva put on a gladiatorial combat in honour of their deceased father with three pairs of gladiators.<br><br>The site was also a religious centre housing the Temple of Hercules Victor, the Temple of Portunus, and the massive 6th or 5th c. BC Great Altar of Hercules.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v5_eVfsfu3VDL09s_3ft9ad-ndqyB1Z-GGaTdyxQbUgnzBSSl2iQPkOZSfQJ88Lx23Xk3J4lEunVD109CVbUXR5kzMf8pCds628sttmzh3HuCB3QSlv5nqkoVXFkl16yLfWHjX6Vb8onpB6D-nCWWsuohIr-Fhj9MkM_aCqo2FJUra3JqaNwvfmVDM0a-hzKkweoCVKzYwFVFtPLA8Y32ypXDXmftYRbmm6eqvl7Ki3kWrS9Vm1zkOy7eAJPQj8rEG3Y7YmnmfbjlvhejHudiu-dyU240N-fSEzgBgBOH_mfohfpcTc8rtImWslntGVMwSfCS-qP35Z84gx0PQoMB6YTRZnoEiDyguE8kTj6MYQ_yd22-gvvZlVs8ELEizlMYCn3bbkv-qzkuvBD7MHKiXhlk03QbAUb86SGCjgCWVMOEi-Y0gJZTXixKvBsEOZhE0eP1cVOL63_kxNObXHEiQ3kXyVDyT0UOWcymcDRVRGYMfTvhmZkDZB9-6Supd2tiB18saUT6J4cMMHnFbnBf29G4cev9yhHrjXA44QcaJTK4wQ2HqdzrCM4urgPe4L0pHTU0hHcnev4f5G1uB7XvjfXfVMvZBkW8zvMUDEwHe_o_He2Q1Qx26yjdWZEi4GaWMUgYFX6Web3M_GUuQiJrvTmCKrwBZR3PS75wDxLU4chyT0_X9oiQinvHXFRV3aQzI7Rpze1t6sLQ" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
