          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Forum Holitorium (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v51xFZQ9M4k6dwyboHed3vRZCMiVHP2keagagm5j_eyP2WPZJQqNnIUu1mNbnsZkFkgGoY4FYcHhyj9d5PNtIzHf5puhbNv1tBdwY2AqgFs3NeqZ0bW8a5e_OFbCXcn0ns2jzcKWgQA90YHAD-tmHy1X77SkSuZzoWkvdQEa6E-70Tint6v7lnteKMIsh3GQlQaXlb2cZBfsugOHK_zwdYjuPPde7oklkJs-w5QBY86HVFE36KPFSwD4HnBbo52BnXcbjaTAf-VUtHz0xOZ1Vcgf3Hth5TFGHiIbmFjJnq49IuANcJZJeqBL7o7GUNijXCTmcDgkZjSEzWFpeNovVlVZq1uATsWb2FXre6b75986TL-Gi8G5kdQxBWSaK-0dJHVZ5-hd6Un2-ujzqXqFPC3KgpuMZHyxCSu60nb0M4PPPw67KDq0dC-3jSOfNPQRL_EaaMlQiQlrN4rwWb2FIT3XXvCQa_1b4E65zVfK-tfPuVnnJcQlG8VCh43U1y68SIO_4tF7byX6nn5Wffcl2nnWs958jemRbNH2YL7_Z_wvGHvv3qJEcdk9wWXfGqSZoH86XTanivRuYvIjdxxmRFk7QL-saLx0ejqAObdnf4EfWZuANldI-n-fOtOR10RbaUiOw3zFZgm8cI1DP53qWPXpyUczv745ntJJYf6rVmeoYvplu-kbY0TlWWIAbF7N8BlWvmJ4c4b" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Vegetable market, Rome.<br><br>The Forum Holitorium was the site of a commercial marketplace for vegetables, herbs and oil. <br><br>It was "oddly located" outside the Porta Carmentalis in the Campus Martius, crowded between the Forum Boarium and buildings located in the Circus Flaminius.]]></description>
