      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Macellum Traiani (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7W0s4-Sm2mLFSTZiy3ZdFNKUtmjDxLENY2M3069nkXfxPZ0JCbWUvZ70z0bRRotOe-d3fXiFH-DpyDREsj-IxRxrTunhxwmT92UV8lwyiMK86tJCsKm3gb83AVTOxMgWPzbLkpHRI7LIhKH-zTWToclN0rDXi1td6aueMj31TKsQMYDiNw9uxrVap-2K0-mZn4BuTe1MQa_i6OQRhKfHgPuZkWOMFaPcid1u_680gvxMCQUgSS0gRpZinz8kmR1qaRQXXxdfd3VLLEctdq7XNyAHjyTpK1DYKYAt4S7kBZNly8t8HuH75cFZaKgeAEVG6Szf-FR_4MRy96m7K9XLKMMk6ZVuBkHbBH6jHoKaep4yPUsriIyj6KuvyiojVAZju3NQPgoXi_VU9hHblQiXKI3a1KyBkzS8dUtYCZ84NrhDlUgDDdtB_aCw9m1BWpT_-LUOlVH5p8jjdIxOXt9QARU8QMM5Y9XDszGfKC09TIQsni9C2g6Kca5S45Vs5taXFFWzbRhalpJlt33AR_l-W7wb77Sksn8-3AS7K5VcDzofWZQbEvUxZ2VnsFhvKn79mbO2yu3BhuUW2kKaGufDesZPvG2K1RvYyT2J-MYCTQflWHw5x2egEqDNn-XxYaiUPpHlsrJkZT1r7iy2SYBSQuKssIw5UtXmX2wtHZyqNFSRorf9IOtntLZzKmRFj4p6V0RaEttiH9" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Market of Trajan, Rome.<br><br>Thought to be the world's oldest shopping mall, the arcades in Trajan's Market are now believed by many to be administrative offices for Emperor Trajan. The shops and apartments were built in a multi-level structure and it is still possible to visit several of the levels. Highlights include delicate marble floors and the remains of a library.<br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6Fp4DdCqrp5FKIx55d830PBOZjYlaRMYHiuIpjpVUdQiSR7e93f0JYv649suA6c4c1JJ6cTMdrkGF12lLEjFC1fWHLvVL9Vgxs5384r4pXhAGuYdAAr703lWUyO62WhZj6BfQZogPjSbJt5olv9_EdVXi_Kzd705upk7pjAghvcgo14y5Da-9NXQG3mxnlokjL5etX-TZz4_KYFXpzS0ICuoAad-Zyf-48_XCxbTouLed1jFDnREAL0wJL8TlnOmKAlRMs49Kd8fa7MfirLu9vMX5gA2q-kzqvryaa6eK7RooNSGqcZwORj6_qkH4CFyPaXtnAqlypseGFHZd6R-W7KNA6FY7eAKQfiG1E1k9bhrtBbI18rqJuNeJAEyvZUMcbSDty-C0tsAREs-gLFZKwVZBzF8MM5n8yT5hB4BLKZaqdyQA4xR3CEEMMfUCxN089WD_LVx41WBiSyhKeHZ2oumxbRMPGn6cfsK-tMJkmg0L_tfNNr1e0aLIG97B-weThrExBffGWJqgNOm4XFz4LReKroMct7QS-1XMT5xmoYlRDJ6sSbr2hCcy48Hs3wzfKm3obS8oJhomAVJNheNLE71c5b0r0fRaSu7qwcvxqYDtqngW8FGuIy9437i1qQ4c9bMFm7bHu_TM1FiHRGMGUhP3Tr4FgIvVGE6xdNV2StlZi9LoRJnMlEtK2E0R-15amkruyUVmHKw" height=