      <Placemark>
        <name>Mons Testarum (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gwo8K7gzg009UziymVZw1frexiRAk_vLxIokV6qnxfy050iJDFnSytVhaN7ODxOZxQwOBR5fM5RcP_7n8C6KiTGY4Ubkud16zahMYlO6ow3jRBbwYOFnAddmXRGe71pfki7GeVVMtc-7EzSdpoqCgZIWSKeHhtpAJQpceivUzed5OA7975puiyClLcUeoxmzeubvDMgWF0mhA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Monte Testaccio, Rome.<br><br>The artificial hill of modern-day Monte Testaccio lies S of the Horrea Galbana in the Emporium area, bordered by Via Galvani, Via Zabaglia, Ex-Mattatoio Comunale and the 3rd c. AD Aurelian Wall, occupying an c. 22,000 sq. m. triangular area (on average: 180 m N–S x 250 m E–W), with a maximum height of 49 m asl and 36 m above the surrounding street level. The elevation of this area was 5 to 6 m lower in antiquity.<br><br>The hill was created by the systematic deposition of amphora sherds to form a terraced pyramidal structure, beginning early in the Augustan era and continuing until its abandonment in 257 AD.<br><br>Though recent archaeological investigations at the Monte Testaccio have not yet found sherds pre-dating 144 AD, it is assumed that the deposition must have started when the Roman province of Baetica was integrated into the Roman economy early during the reign of Augustus, since a large proportion of amphoras uncovered on the site are Baetican olive-oil types. Further, by the late-Republican period the Emporium was already well developed with massive warehouses as well as a monumental tomb structure of the Rusticelii family immediately to the S of the hill'', that demarcated its limits.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw4bEleVLIK4cI0ZcQUN62dnyozBQ8Mtezizvw_AECoKVr2isouWs9_9fRbIy1_Ia4MI05kiaa0AqoufWHBEk36zzdVE2mAsDdeljcF4ZC4OGDxfu3iKALk0TcfrjomkvknlxZDXIG0EGDDhGmFEt5Bc_-_K5uKcn7tRITdPwanjVTx6zl2lvUYjJZo70g5VH_JSkOSkYUD9DM?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1857-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gwo8K7gzg009UziymVZw1frexiRAk_vLxIokV6qnxfy050iJDFnSytVhaN7ODxOZxQwOBR5fM5RcP_7n8C6KiTGY4Ubkud16zahMYlO6ow3jRBbwYOFnAddmXRGe71pfki7GeVVMtc-7EzSdpoqCgZIWSKeHhtpAJQpceivUzed5OA7975puiyClLcUeoxmzeubvDMgWF0mhA?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw4bEleVLIK4cI0ZcQUN62dnyozBQ8Mtezizvw_AECoKVr2isouWs9_9fRbIy1_Ia4MI05kiaa0AqoufWHBEk36zzdVE2mAsDdeljcF4ZC4OGDxfu3iKALk0TcfrjomkvknlxZDXIG0EGDDhGmFEt5Bc_-_K5uKcn7tRITdPwanjVTx6zl2lvUYjJZo70g5VH_JSkOSkYUD9DM?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
