      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Castra Priora Equitum Singularium Augusti</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GyHP1kBas4T8Wo4ewGk5XLJuVfWJgsR7KfhLADJwavHBfPie19Fw_-ouzXYGabOjG4YS-4DqMxlfB-euZWCLlVDtyjyqTbipbKKrZF4HFtITrdHomu1057DfdSi-HrlgNMmbcl7m3j_sjjnAlSxcGkJEOkAD7wznt_RD68Z79dPcq6Sd0owzLrSXLi3K0nJsGGu17qxnvPJuA?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Imperial Cavalry Guard barracks, Rome.<br><br>The remains of the oldest one were found in 1885-1889 on the Caelian (via Tasso), together with numerous inscriptions dedicated to different deities that were to be housed in the barracks sanctuary.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gw93scir9lgQwKJZPQI0D2rjjSuXnkMBbTnB5YQsYZzj6NWoevfdBs_CCfSnJ10hY9IXrWQAVcZAGafsrNRPHqZPRhohvZymbAgdB0AGehiC7Ug6fvrG7SBmalmhbSK6LTDmoIP6wBO59Y6PYo7ucZg3HCCdHxSETPHvYSVU5AHEdo8jeYCNrD35QsiFTVV8jjmHTKJvXbZuQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
