    <Folder>
      <name>Funerary</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Columbaria (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxpznAQpudvYSYpnEDsTyYGVdMD_J-F2bHywtSribqrMdgQXPCrgggK8wpHEyTqcNuubm9x6AcZMJ6NrU2zEmZEU_a3cxCRX3nSwq0maevk41wxfkHLKqhgmdgtKKVlJT6mgv8PVy6cP10fp0qyE-pXUr9id4Tmd19c0iBP1oN3yS5KezEOaAUQAVVm7qCJJrTZGfIKbUDaaQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tomb, Rome. <br><br>A well-preserved reticulate columbarium of square plan (c. 6 x 5 m, 7 m deep) with over 300 loculi was excavated near the Via Appia in 1847.<br><br> An inscription dated to 10 AD provides a terminus ante quem for the tomb. Inscribed cinerary urns recovered from the site confirm that it was opened under Augustus, and indicate that the tomb continued to receive burials through the Julio-Claudian period. Many of the deceased freedmen and slaves interred here served the imperial household, so it is sometimes called the “Monumentum Marcellae”.<br><br>In the decades following Augustus’ death, two other large columbaria (one of 450 loculi, the other with 800) were opened in the immediate vicinity of this tomb; these three monuments are often grouped as the “Columbaria of the Vigna Codini”. These tombs attest to the continuing popularity of the Via Appia as a burial site, yet witness a changing demographic: the distinctive family tombs of the Republican élite were soon surrounded and far outnumbered by columbaria filled with Rome’s middle and lower classes.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzEpMfooOshjSRhsV6c_qihpo_uwoQzbt1OYX7BpfVk2IKSLgA3B7ecnSdqsqz0YBh6FFqfkXjJIAkexnSCuJQ1kyuGRZYbWDpXIBvw9_XIIW7gcYSIxQEo8JdNuC4kBiYo0-5RAPsajFPXNMVULlshYtTtiNeKvshwiv4wXHUYOZQYmlv2Gl6-Ksut16rq3V3AV7so8Q2t8Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1556-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxpznAQpudvYSYpnEDsTyYGVdMD_J-F2bHywtSribqrMdgQXPCrgggK8wpHEyTqcNuubm9x6AcZMJ6NrU2zEmZEU_a3cxCRX3nSwq0maevk41wxfkHLKqhgmdgtKKVlJT6mgv8PVy6cP10fp0qyE-pXUr9id4Tmd19c0iBP1oN3yS5KezEOaAUQAVVm7qCJJrTZGfIKbUDaaQ?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzEpMfooOshjSRhsV6c_qihpo_uwoQzbt1OYX7BpfVk2IKSLgA3B7ecnSdqsqz0YBh6FFqfkXjJIAkexnSCuJQ1kyuGRZYbWDpXIBvw9_XIIW7gcYSIxQEo8JdNuC4kBiYo0-5RAPsajFPXNMVULlshYtTtiNeKvshwiv4wXHUYOZQYmlv2Gl6-Ksut16rq3V3AV7so8Q2t8Q?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
