      <Placemark>
        <name>Columbarium Libertorum Liviae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Tomb of Livia's freedmen, Rome.<br><br>Close to the columbarium of her husband, it could also hold 3,000 urns.<br><br>Unfortunately it was destroyed shorly after it was discovered on the second mile of via Appia in 1724-26.]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1556-A52714</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            12.5078049,41.8638855,0
          </coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Columbarium Pomponii Hylae (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gwsc20GgIyeyTUmm3JvOcHJousvfTwJ7u-O6TXApiNHZH7dEtY3oOBxB3ie-t-pu95ueEkTDmMVr9qLUJT9ghTRojXqhmAAjLrFweHhviwJqypGCUcThtB56a_69xWVCRvHq8m_cjphZAmkscd22nOckoja1d6X0ciHO26EX3Ja6Q94fJphUzw1KEsSOkzfVQ-42PlW0wTso0s?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tomb of Pomponius Hylas, Rome.<br><br>The columbarium of Pomponio Hylas is a 1st c. AD columbarium, discovered completely intact, located near Porta Latina on the Via Appia , shortly after leaving the city, with entrance from the Parco degli Scipioni. It was discovered in 1831 by Giampietro Campana.<br><br>Although it takes its name from Pomponius Hylas, who lived in the Flavian period, the building was dated between 14-54 AD thanks to two of its niches (one dedicated to a freedman of Tiberius and l other to a freedman of Claudia Ottavia, daughter of Claudius and Messalina). It was later bought by Pomponius for himself and his wife; he added a mosaic panel on the entrance steps, which is decorated with griffins and an incription.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GzdxLQJaaL03d1YE0BKCr4YucsWLM3pzS47C3PfKy_DL9AjDEZwrNyLNDRPqR9iTbLN_M3TvIsVSDE4bLq8XO3-Kk9CE7zp6_eiULPAR2M8du6StKipNxVfkE7TSO5WkLwVXBMkMY0Er8RS0_LqODtJkWURUixOS0hOqTXZw0bqE8NufO0ozHhmN9l5EWh6WGkdtBaHGHli3A?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GwQqa1yX5hRqBuxn2a7l_o22Xg6E7QqeiFlMZwKv5EF9OrYiYKDvXiP-NWnvpG3y4tvTsQQ21tnsBVuR9wD3eN5oMRcHWtPKQdcQ85MfAQMnijLypj1jQDrhQBn7ldmh-JgllqZA5H4kfNScV1X8Sfmg8UM1Zh9qVWZNmu2yp2TCFVecDiILgwEgUjaIsjU0OV7tv2voT_Szg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1556-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
