      <Placemark>
        <name>Mausoleum Augusti (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7npIcT_6_qOW7MS5E2wX5k1SqtYGDt0h6d4zBTKi5UnxCP8IpfBqnAs039j3GztG7kOOy0a23uA4POqroQamdJAarb2rLmkD3EiFvv7H1CVPDWO-dYAxMs03-MmaA_aXxfu8w3P-NZH1qiMqT21SHboP-Cfg5qBZhbOJDVWiBrK6jMwTqekkxXEcua-JJ0nDZBW9fZUpA4H2tQZExDyyne4cgX5TekHPCBek_TTogbSyCfPoEYl-fut5pg89hSRpMT5kF3Bt2n2mAliC9QK7dACTmUJ3gGHXbnfkZaM16LLnjLFRJiEwB9w0qmFdmlfoMfBwNjY43gbL66a0N9ZjybHWUl5TV83EeR6yLC6PrFn1HA-tJOgovu7TtzW6zjinZWYPpPIpaDGrm7A1OETagWIGGHt95eUe8IyoNNVFvb7SC47Ea4EafJCZ_XeRf-pgVKUumuE3AT-97kRrKAZn8LF0tih7awBrAWO1CAlP_VMrr9q3WGzW127bNlWqt66ehhhd4tTaaSuIFbTYxrwqol_iznnPWNFVcgYJ4FLWcdTokyc53TxTM9zIy8s2kNaj3XQQzvT94N0AYfzZZOY51bVvhlNjAQnaci0rv6F_dQ1mSDDpUnrQZ_iaJRzfv9W1F_oK_uvp2TrZ84_flfRF0N0L1nhD9v0zEzcyYq8Ex2Mm7ssU0bwClmofNCVZfORDUeAt47WL68" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tomb of Augustus, Rome.<br><br>One of the few surviving Augustan monuments is the monumental tomb built by Octavian early in his reign for both his own burial as well as the interment of other members of gens Iulia and his notable friends.<br><br> In 1934, the environs of the ancient structure were cleared of residential urban fabric as part of the creation of a Fascist architectural ensemble at Piazzale Augusto Imperatore. The archaeological excavations and primary architectural restorations were completed in 1938.<br><br>In antiquity, the location of the Mausoleum, immediately W of the Via Flaminia, fell within the N limits of the Campus Martius. Its colossal architectural form marked the N entrance to the marshland of the Campus, having been built at the mouth of the isthmus created between Collis Hortulorum and the Tiber.<br><br>According to Suetonius, the building was already completed by 28 BC, but perhaps only to a certain extent, since at the time of the first burial at the Mausoleum (that of Marcellus in 23 BC), the construction may not have been complete. <br><br><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6tZ49FWY_1DfyhxAkRLEWy-SACzn5GyE47KKcX2zBB1Ab0MfziYVixcd3zR53ELy9PzEhQOllq4ku2P6gG-Q_muYWWwzWjocx84-nGmkrXEk0CGCU2X65w8-Ci_FuzD72CCk1Z72spPvJg-9Tb3-uxEMkLiC9ABUlS_1fD7WM34A7NOjeId_Huig1VY3ZgMpCXP0LJUlenslqZ6aQDnVWGyihNpO-XJOYyvUGJmQYVNvZtGI3pWnC7D7l6Q7wAaWgaehNJNfTiBfkWgcTapVAY0fh5F1bIlg09oHCe4SnEqAeM57nuL1tZxlyzj7QGDiX3JnQwrqe3cIvBc10kv7THxqmkFA2ASwPQrez1Ju4sqLoZm49RlpeRpelAVxZRzX1d1KY3KQCBjkTtkG-KV2dsTcSiCqANuhhC1AAwlh0CBEFmL12B3wxQsKNXh6K7Nx1u0If7C7uNWh3X4A9kHWpUg6uInPmAWS17hqAhl3vcB17a4dzFOtDhDJrOEK2SmdhbSOcK7G3rMAonrbW1QTj6U7RjCBM2qNIgE8i0s9lOkLoHSJgr0j0F10TpU1tUQPe_Eb5VpCjY5aGxya4W_v2CD93cWbdracYO0czZ_B8QAJgUASMyyPkP0Dn9k0AUdVRkR8Urrsec61dE5swCko---wqoxAz0vBqWcj5K0qYp0wGJMfUZe9R9kOho62_aHMl5rCsUiLSiPg" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
