      <Placemark>
        <name>Mausoleum Hadriani (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6IXNl4xPU-UaibfLmVmbV_uiUkuzwU-gigCNd6wzDmhivvegGr0qW5QJyr3oEdV5g3oB5PrW3J9P7aitK-W91UdjwQ91MBDY59L9HtfyK_SRJtjAnhkBQNe8fmoob0wLRebBFdMGxb2FxwPNELL6akFUgYJUFpUZXWSzLHcaTQp3weCHTvX8gTsOzwiZOuZvM2v0FKTt1qlAzFFQ8iN26lf3NVABo1JxlBk0hOmeRfut8I-EIrdtbcSmrzPnG1SC6OsdOx8xYT0BcirJnKELeBAaqq2KfTCyBkwU-cp_iQ-Xtjzvzargp8CjBOPSX_ZMGaoNgrEjYBRHGY1rcgTTwcWzn8vkPv0K4DyMGAaSA4AvnwcOsMfAWR4e5pkkj_EixsoQYvpJGIGDzR2pU58JrEE_5tWKu9yw-6MPDhMxs9vSEo1JDAbch1Ku8cXh3hGINKi6yAcU8sk1PSLenvT_VgE10fOsFsHpRZxwyoQrA6Bmhk9L71ifmylpEh2PW-nzIvl9iMcmduvk2sIkQMWrFzHsOrQYgAcGL7ZsCgtrKT-037h0llQZSKI4ok6KsKpGSH5XqqxyZEACxTUo2cIF9vQTyiEooHdki3qmj9UKD1Eiegl2ZZoLnP_YygeWrRCHBM9nq6xfyykXh9XQdjGE5gu86sNAcxnrs4FVTXTTRQ59XGhzwCbq1vgj7e9Lmn_SU3BlolTANViA" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tomb of Hadrian, Rome.<br><br>The tomb of the emperor Hadrian was erected on the right bank of the Tiber, between 134-139 AD.<br><br> Originally the mausoleum was a decorated cylinder, with a garden top and golden quadriga. Hadrian's ashes were placed here a year after his death in Baiae in 138 AD, together with those of his wife Sabina, and his first adopted son, Lucius Aelius, who also died in 138.<br><br> Following this, the remains of succeeding emperors were also placed here, the last recorded deposition being Caracalla in 217 AD. The urns containing these ashes were probably placed in what is now known as the Treasury room deep within the building. Hadrian also built the Pons Aelius facing straight onto the mausoleum – it still provides a scenic approach from the center of Rome and the left bank of the Tiber, and is renowned for the Baroque additions of statues of angels holding aloft instruments of the Passion of Christ.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxOoNYSWLWVjhBIYoPPcLMcPlpwInBfODekvzGg52473ZTmdqc_1SRzD4NY7Vyw13GRp94T_KHhbODQOgwE-hSeOJ6n8fNENSnof97IZcSAHFKnofZHB9M6_NywQkA__PG-uASF0NYho4A6J8lH0PXFxxXRfKFbigFS8FwIFnJLL2lNvo_4shfV0FpQChavSe27YHL0NVBP-w?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1556-673AB7</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
