      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Sepulcrum M. Vergilii Eurysacum (Roma, Italia)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gzqya5mfz9cQP3bvBecJwW8aeHShp0uAAE5irLCa60WVipk8IAG15Ufmo64E69DLoMHYDxvXYvl1lvAaF-i8J49rD_NO7rDFZvTyG1O3_oeOQLFfqogRgDEjGbVGrCTzOI68_YlrNaOkWjgtXdWy38MvhBHgje9IJdVbdJSAsB0qKixryWEgDRoli21mjiDy_6iRD52CkyRdg?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Tomb of M. Vergilius Eurysaces, Rome.<br><br>Sepulchral monument erected by M. Vergilius Eurysaces, a wholesale baker, inside the fork of the Via Praenestina and Via Labicana just outside the line of aqueducts. <br><br>It is dated to the decade 30-20 BC. In the 3rd c. AD it was enclosed within one of the semicircular towers of the porta Praenestina of the Aurelian Wall, hence its exceptional state of preservation. <br><br>A relief representing various stages of bread production runs along the top of the tomb. The relief depicts, on the south side, the delivery and grinding of grain and sifting of flour; on the north, the mixing and kneading of dough, forming of round loaves, and baking in a domed "pizza-type" oven; and, on the west, the stacking of loaves in baskets and their being taken for weighing.<br><br>In 1838 it was again exposed. Excavations have established its ground-plan as trapezoidal in shape, with a sharp apex (destroyed with the construction of the semicircular tower). There were many other tombs which lined Via Labicana E of the Porta Maggiore, some of which have been excavated but not identified or dated.<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxbKjDtoXC1MuvOgI8uZEkdYljD1W4SVrk046QWz52Sj5Xe0iVp-8tnNyFmqnNUmYSAV13hUjdiElygzJ8DrBJFe-ZEIgIQeUeytxeb3rBB1oVLTqkZfZ23z4Qs1XZXQxOehxiz52H1PaYOufbWdCFmegfAxAp9mNiOyC-EaTA2vzV4cgDrWzjq800JEsOR50eAmDiaoC4gPBU?authuser=0&fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1556-A52714</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="gx_media_links">
            <value><![CDATA[https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_Gzqya5mfz9cQP3bvBecJwW8aeHShp0uAAE5irLCa60WVipk8IAG15Ufmo64E69DLoMHYDxvXYvl1lvAaF-i8J49rD_NO7rDFZvTyG1O3_oeOQLFfqogRgDEjGbVGrCTzOI68_YlrNaOkWjgtXdWy38MvhBHgje9IJdVbdJSAsB0qKixryWEgDRoli21mjiDy_6iRD52CkyRdg?authuser=0&fife=s16383 https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AE5a_GxbKjDtoXC1MuvOgI8uZEkdYljD1W4SVrk046QWz52Sj5Xe0iVp-8tnNyFmqnNUmYSAV13hUjdiElygzJ8DrBJFe-ZEIgIQeUeytxeb3rBB1oVLTqkZfZ23z4Qs1XZXQxOehxiz52H1PaYOufbWdCFmegfAxAp9mNiOyC-EaTA2vzV4cgDrWzjq800JEsOR50eAmDiaoC4gPBU?authuser=0&fife=s16383]]></value>
